window.DH_SEARCH=[{"i":"e01p0101","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"My name is Mary Alice Young.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0102","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"When you read this morning's paper, you may come across an article about the unusual day I had last week.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0103","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"Normally, there's never anything newsworthy about my life, but that all changed last Thursday.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0104","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"Of course, everything seemed quite normal at first.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0105","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"I made breakfast for my family,","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0106","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"I performed my chores.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0107","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"I completed my projects.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0108","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"I ran my errands.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0109","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"In truth, I spent the day as I spent every other day, quietly polishing the routine of my life until it gleamed with perfection.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0110","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"That's why it was so astonishing when I decided to go to my hallway closet and retrieve a revolver that had never been used.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0111","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"My body was discovered by my neighbor, Mrs. Martha Huber, who'd been startled by a strange popping sound.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0112","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"Her curiosity aroused, Mrs. Huber tried to think of a reason for dropping in on me unannounced.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0113","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"After some initial hesitation, she decided to return the blender she had borrowed from me six months before.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0114","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"It's my neighbor. I think she's been shot. There's blood everywhere. ","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p0115","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"Yes, you've got to send an ambulance. You've got to send one right now.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p0116","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"And for a moment, Mrs. Huber stood motionless in her kitchen, grief-stricken by this senseless tragedy. ","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0117","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"But, only for a moment.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0118","e":"e01","p":"p01","t":"If there was one thing Mrs. Huber was known for, it was her ability to look on the bright side.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p0201","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"I was laid to rest on a Monday.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0202","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"After the funeral, all the residents of Wisteria Lane came to pay their respects.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0203","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"And, as people do in these situations, they brought food.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0204","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Lynette Scavo brought fried chicken.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0205","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Lynette had a great family recipe for fried chicken.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0206","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Of course, she didn't cook much while she was moving up the corporate ladder. She didn't have the time.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0207","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"But when her doctor announced Lynette was pregnant, her husband Tom had an idea.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0208","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Why not quit your job? Kids do better with stay-at-home moms, so it would be so much less stressful.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0209","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"But this was not the case.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0210","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"In fact, Lynette's life had become so hectic, she was now forced to get her fried chicken from the fast-food restaurant.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0211","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Lynette would've appreciated the irony if she'd stopped to think about it.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0212","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"But she couldn't. She didn't have the time.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0213","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"No, you are going to behave today. I am not going to be humiliated in front of the entire neighborhood. And, just so you know how serious I am...","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0214","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"What's that?","s":"Boy"},{"i":"e01p0215","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Santa's cell-phone number.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0216","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"How did you get that?","s":"Boy"},{"i":"e01p0217","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"I know someone who knows someone who knows an elf.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0218","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"And if any of you acts up, so help me, I will call Santa. I will tell him you want socks for Christmas.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0219","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"Are you willing to risk that?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0220","e":"e01","p":"p02","t":"OK, let's get this over with.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0301","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Gabrielle Solis, who lives down the block, brought a spicy paella.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0302","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Since her modeling days in New York, Gabrielle had developed a taste for rich food and rich men.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0303","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Carlos, who worked in mergers and acquisitions, proposed on their third date.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0304","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Gabrielle was touched when tears welled up in his eyes.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0305","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"But she soon discovered this happened every time Carlos closed a big deal.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0306","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Gabrielle liked her paella piping hot.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0307","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"However, her relationship with her husband was considerably cooler.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0308","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"If you talk to Al Mason at this thing, I want you to casually mention how much I paid for your necklace.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p0309","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Why don't I just pin the receipt to my chest?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0310","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"He let me know how much he paid for his wife's new convertible.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p0311","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Look, just work it into the conversation.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p0312","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"There's no way I can just work that in, Carlos.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0313","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Why not? At the Donahue party, everyone was talking mutual funds. And you found a way to mention you slept with half the Yankee outfield.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p0314","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"I'm telling you, it came up in the context of the conversation.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0315","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Hey, people are starting to stare. Can you keep your voice down, please?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p0316","e":"e01","p":"p03","t":"Absolutely, we wouldn't want them to think we're not happy.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0401","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Bree Van De Kamp, who lives next door, brought baskets of muffins she baked from scratch.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0402","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Bree was known for her cooking.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0403","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"And for making her own clothes.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0404","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"And for doing her own gardening.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0405","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"And for reupholstering her own furniture.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0406","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Yes, Bree's many talents were known throughout the neighborhood.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0407","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"And everyone on Wisteria Lane thought of Bree as the perfect wife and mother.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0408","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Everyone, that is, except her own family.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0409","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Bree, you shouldn't have gone to all this trouble.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e01p0410","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"It was no trouble at all.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0411","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Now, the basket with the red ribbon is filled with desserts for your guests.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0412","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"But the one with the blue ribbon is just for you and Zachary.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0413","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"It's got rolls, muffins, breakfast type things.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0414","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Well, the least I could do is make sure you boys had a decent meal to look forward to in the morning.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0415","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"I know you're out of your minds with grief.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0416","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Yes, we are.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e01p0417","e":"e01","p":"p04","t":"Of course, I will need the baskets back once you're done.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0501","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Susan Mayer, who lives across the street, brought macaroni and cheese.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0502","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Her husband, Carl, always teased her about her macaroni, saying it was the only thing she knew how to cook and she rarely made it well.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0503","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"It was too salty the night she and Carl moved into their house.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0504","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"It was too watery the night she found lipstick on Carl's shirt.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0505","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"She burned it the night Carl told her he was leaving her for his secretary.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0506","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"A year had passed since the divorce.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0507","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Susan had started to think how nice it would be to have a man in her life.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0508","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Even one who would make fun of her cooking.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0509","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Mom, why would someone kill themselves?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p0510","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Well, sometimes people are so unhappy, they think that's the only way they can solve their problems.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0511","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"But Mrs. Young always seemed happy.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p0512","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Yeah, sometimes people pretend to be one way on the outside when they're totally different on the inside.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0513","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"Are you meaning, like, how dad's girlfriend is always smiling, says nice things, but deep down, you just know she's a bitch.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p0514","e":"e01","p":"p05","t":"I don't like that word, Julie. But, yeah, that's a great example.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0601","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"So, what did Carl say when you confronted him?","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0602","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"You'll love this. He said \"It doesn't mean anything, it was just sex.\"","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0603","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Ah, yes, page one of the philanderer's handbook.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0604","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Yeah, and then he got this Zen look on his face, and he said, \"You know, Susan, most men live lives of quiet desperation.\"","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0605","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Please tell me you punched him.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0606","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"No, I said, \"Really? And what do most women live? lives of noisy fulfillment?\"","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0607","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Hmm, good for you.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0608","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"I mean, of all people, did he have to bang his secretary? I had that woman over for brunch.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0609","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"It's like my grandmother always said, an erect penis doesn't have a conscience.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0610","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Even the limp ones aren't that ethical.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0611","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"This is half the reason I joined the NRA. ","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0612","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Well, when Rex started going to those medical conferences, I wanted it in the back of his mind that he had a loving wife at home with a loaded Smith & Wesson.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0613","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Lynnie, Tom's always away on business. Do you ever worry he might?","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0614","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Oh, please, the man's got me pregnant 3 times in 4 years. I wish he was having sex with someone else.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0615","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"So, Susan, is he gonna stop seeing that woman?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0616","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"I don't know. I'm sorry, you guys, I just don't know how I'm gonna survive this.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0617","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"Listen to me, we all have moments of desperation.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0618","e":"e01","p":"p06","t":"But if we can face them head on, that's when we find out just how strong we really are.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0701","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"Susan, I was just saying Paul wants us to go over on Friday.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0702","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"He needs us to go through Mary Alice's closet and help pack up her things.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0703","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"He said he can't face doing it by himself.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p0704","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"If Mary Alice was having problems, she should have come to us, she should've let us help her.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0705","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"What kinds of problems could she have had?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0706","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"She was healthy, had a great home, a nice family, her life was... Our life.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0707","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"No. If Mary Alice was having some sort of crisis, we'd have known.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0708","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"She lives 50 feet away, for God's sake.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p0709","e":"e01","p":"p07","t":"Gabby, the woman killed herself. Something must've been going on.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0801","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"I wouldn't eat that if I were you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0802","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"I made it. Trust me. Hey, do you have a death wish?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0803","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"No, I just refuse to believe that anybody can screw up macaroni and cheese.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p0804","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Oh my god. How did you...? It tastes like it's burned and undercooked.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p0805","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Yeah, I get that a lot. Here you go.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0806","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Thanks, I'm Mike Delfino. I just started renting the Sims' house next door.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p0807","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Susan Mayer. I live across the street.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0808","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Oh yeah, Mrs. Huber told me about you, said you illustrate children's books.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p0809","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Yeah, I'm very big with the under-five set. What do you do?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0810","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Plumber. So if you ever have a clog... or something.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p0811","e":"e01","p":"p08","t":"Now that everybody's seen that I brought something. I should probably just throw this out.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p0901","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Ease up, you little vampire.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0902","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Lynette, I've been looking all over for you. Are you aware of what your sons are doing?","s":"Mrs. Huber"},{"i":"e01p0903","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Cannonball!","s":"Kid"},{"i":"e01p0904","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Stop! What are you doing? We are at a wake.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0905","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"When we got here, you said we could go in the pool.","s":"Kid"},{"i":"e01p0906","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"I said you could go by the pool. Do you have your swimsuits on?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0907","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Yeah, we put them on under our clothes just before we left.","s":"Kid"},{"i":"e01p0908","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"You three planned this? All right. That's it. Get out. I am your mother. You have to do what I say. Come on.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0909","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"We wanna swim and you can't stop us!","s":"Kid"},{"i":"e01p0910","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Think I won't get in this pool and just grab you? Get out! Get over here.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0911","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Paul, we have to leave now. Once again, I am so sorry for your loss.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p0912","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"Lynette shouldn't have been so concerned about my husband. ","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p0913","e":"e01","p":"p09","t":"He had other things on his mind. Things below the surface.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1001","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"The morning after my funeral, my friends and neighbors quietly went back to their busy, busy lives.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1002","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"While some did their cooking. And some did their cleaning. And some did their yoga. Others did their \"homework\"","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1003","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"Hi, I'm Julie. I kicked my soccer ball into your backyard.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1004","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"Oh, OK. Well, let's go around and get it.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1005","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"His wife died a year ago. He wanted to stay in LA, but there were too many memories. He is renting for tax purposes, but he hopes to buy a place real soon.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1006","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"I can't believe you went over there.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1007","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"Hey, I saw you both flirting at the wake. You are obviously into each other. Now that you know he is single, you can ask him out.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1008","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"Julie, I like Mr. Delfino, I do. I just... I don't even know if I'm ready to start dating yet.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1009","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"You need to get back out there. Come on. How long has it been since you had sex? Are you mad that I asked you that?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1010","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"No, I'm just trying to remember. I don't wanna talk to you about my love life anymore. It weirds me out.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1011","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"I wouldn't have said anything. It's just...","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1012","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"What?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1013","e":"e01","p":"p10","t":"I heard Dad's girlfriend ask if you'd dated anyone since the divorce. And Dad said he doubted it. And then they both laughed.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1101","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Hi, Mike. I brought you a little house-warming gift. I probably should've brought something by earlier, but...","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1102","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Actually, you're the first neighbor who stopped by.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1103","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Really?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1104","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Susan knew she was lucky. An eligible bachelor had moved on to Wisteria Lane, and she was the first to find out.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1105","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"But she also knew that good news travels quickly.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1106","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Hello, there.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1107","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Eddie Britt was the most predatory divorcee in a five-block radius.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1108","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Her conquests were numerous, varied and legendary.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1109","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"I hope I'm not interrupting. You must be Mike Delfino. Hi, I'm Eddie Britt. I live over there. Welcome to Wisteria Lane.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1110","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Susan had met the enemy. And she was a slut.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1111","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Thank you. What's this?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1112","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Sausage puttanesca. It's just something I threw together.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1113","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Thanks, Eddie. That's great. I'd invite you both in, but I was sort of in the middle of something.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1114","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"I'm late for an appointment anyway.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1115","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"No problem, I just wanted to say hi.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1116","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"And just like that, the race for Mike Delfino had begun.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1117","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"For a moment, Susan wondered if her rivalry with Eddie would remain friendly.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1118","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"But she was reminded that when it came to men — women don't fight fair.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1119","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Oh, Mike. I heard you're a plumber. Do you think you could stop by later tonight and take a look at my pipes?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1120","e":"e01","p":"p11","t":"Sure.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1201","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"You can't order me around like I am a child. No, no. I'm not going.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1202","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"It's business. Tanaka expects everyone to bring their wives.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1203","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Every time I'm around that man, he tries to grab my ass.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1204","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"I made over $200,000 doing business with him last year. If he wants to grab your ass, you let him.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1205","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"John!","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1206","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Mr. Solis, you scared me.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1207","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Why is that bush still there? You were supposed to dig it up last week.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1208","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"I didn't have time last week.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1209","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"I don't want to hear your excuses. Just take care of it.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1210","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"I really hate the way you talk to me.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1211","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"And I really hate that I spent $15,000 on your diamond necklace that you couldn’t live without.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1212","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":" But I'm learning to deal with it. So, can I tell Tanaka we'll be there tomorrow night?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1213","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"John, we have bandages, top shelf in the kitchen.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1214","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Thanks, Mrs. Solis.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1215","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Fine, I'll go. But I'm keeping my back pressed against the wall the entire time.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1216","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"See, now this is what a marriage is all about. Compromise.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p1217","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Is your finger OK?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1218","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Yeah, it's just a small cut.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1219","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Let me see. Mm.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1220","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"You know, Mrs. Solis, I really like it when we hook up, but you know, I gotta get my work done and I can't afford to lose this job.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1221","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"This table was hand-carved. Carlos had it imported from Italy. It cost him $23,000.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1222","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"You want to do it on the table this time?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1223","e":"e01","p":"p12","t":"Absolutely.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1301","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Why can't we ever have normal soup?","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e01p1302","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Danielle, there is nothing abnormal about basil puree.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1303","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Just once, couldn't we have a soup that people have heard of? Like French onion or navy bean.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e01p1304","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"First of all, your father can't eat onions. He's deathly allergic. And I won't even dignify your navy bean suggestion. So, how's the Ossobuco?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1305","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"It's OK.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1306","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"It's OK? Andrew, I spent 3 hours cooking this meal. How do you think it makes me feel when you say \"it's OK\" in that sullen tone?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1307","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Who asked you to spend 3 hours on dinner?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1308","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Excuse me?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1309","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Tim Harper's mom gets home from work, pops open a can of pork and beans, and boom, they're eating, everyone's happy.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1310","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"You'd rather I serve pork and beans?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1311","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Apologize now. I am begging.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e01p1312","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"I'm saying, do you always have to serve cuisine? Can't we ever just have food?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1313","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Are you doing drugs?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1314","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"What?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1315","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Change in behavior is one of the warning signs, and you have been as fresh as paint for the last six months.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1316","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"That certainly would explain why you're always locked in the bathroom.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1317","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Trust me, that is not what he is doing.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e01p1318","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Shut up. Mom, I'm not the one with the problem here, alright? You're the one always acting like she's running for mayor of Stepford.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1319","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Rex, Seeing as you're the head of this household, I would really appreciate you saying something.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1320","e":"e01","p":"p13","t":"Pass the salt?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1401","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Three days after my funeral, Lynette replaced her grief with a much more useful emotion - Indignation.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1402","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Tom, this is my fifth message and you still haven't called me back. Well, you must be having a lot of fun on your business trip, I can only imagine.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1403","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Well, guess what? The kids and I want to have some fun, too. So unless you call me back by noon, we are getting on a plane and joining you.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1404","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Not now, honey. Mommy's threatening Daddy. Where are your brothers?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1405","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Lynette Scavo?","s":"Klein"},{"i":"e01p1406","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Crap. Natalie Klein. I don't believe it.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1407","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Lynette. How long has it been?","s":"Klein"},{"i":"e01p1408","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Years. How are you? How's the firm?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1409","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Good. Everyone misses you. We all say if you hadn't quit, you'd be running the place by now.","s":"Klein"},{"i":"e01p1410","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"So, how's domestic life? Don't you just love being a mom?","s":"Klein"},{"i":"e01p1411","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"And there it was, the question that Lynette always dreaded.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1412","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"For those who asked it, only one answer was acceptable. So Lynette responded as she always did. She lied.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1413","e":"e01","p":"p14","t":"Well, to be honest, it's the best job I've ever had.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1501","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"You know what I don't get?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1502","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"What?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1503","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Why you married Mr. Solis.","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1504","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Well, he promised to give me everything I've ever wanted.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1505","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"And did he?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1506","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Yes.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1507","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Then why aren't you happy?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1508","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Turns out I wanted all the wrong things.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1509","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"So do you love him?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1510","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"I do.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1511","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Well, then, why are we here? Why are we doing this?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1512","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Because I don't wanna wake up one morning with a sudden urge to blow my brains out.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1513","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Hey, can I have a drag?","s":"John"},{"i":"e01p1514","e":"e01","p":"p15","t":"Absolutely not. You are much too young to smoke.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p1601","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"How would you feel about me using your child support payments for plastic surgery?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1602","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Stop being so nervous. You're just asking him out to dinner. It's no big deal.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1603","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"You're right. So is that your project for school? You know, when I was in fifth grade, I made the White House out of sugar cubes.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1604","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Stop stalling and go. Before Mike figures out he can do better.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1605","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Tell me again why I fought for custody of you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1606","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"You were using me to hurt Dad.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1607","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Oh, that's right.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1608","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Are you busy?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1609","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"No, not at all. What's up?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1610","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Well, I just was wondering if there was any chance that you... I just wanted to ask if... Eddie. What are you...?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1611","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"I was making ambrosia, and I made too much so I thought I'd bring some over to Mike. What's going on?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1612","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Susan was just going to ask me something.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1613","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"I have a clog. And you're a plumber, right? The clog's in the pipe.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1614","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Yeah. That's usually where they are.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1615","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Well, I've got one.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1616","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"OK, let me get my tools.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1617","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Now? You want to come over now? You have company.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1618","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"I don't mind.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p1619","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Just give me two minutes. I'll be right over.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1620","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"That's it. Just stuff the hair down there.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1621","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"I stuffed it. It's not enough to clog it.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1622","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Here, look, Put in this peanut butter and this cooking oil. And these olives.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1623","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Mom, I'm telling you, it's not working.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p1624","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Oh, god. That's him. How am I going to stop up the sink?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1625","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"Well, here's your problem. Looks like somebody stuffed a bunch of popsicle sticks down here.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p1626","e":"e01","p":"p16","t":"I've told Julie a million times not to play in the kitchen. Kids, you know.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p1701","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"All right, I'll go put in your orders, and I'll be right back with your drinks and your plates for the salad bar.","s":"waiter"},{"i":"e01p1702","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Andrew, Danielle, napkins?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1703","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"They have video games. Could we go play until our food gets here?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e01p1704","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Andrew, this is family time.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1705","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Go ahead and play.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1706","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"I know that you think I'm angry about coming here, but I'm not.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1707","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"You and the kids wanted a change of pace, something fun, I get it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1708","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Probably we'll want something healthier tomorrow night, though. I'm thinking about chicken saltimbocca.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1709","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"I want a divorce. I just can't live in this detergent commercial anymore.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1710","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"The salad bar's right over there. Help yourself.","s":"waiter"},{"i":"e01p1711","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Um, I think I'll go get your salad for you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1712","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Bree Van De Kamp.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p1713","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Oh. Hello, Mrs. Huber.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1714","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"We didn't get a chance to talk at Mary Alice's wake. How are you doing?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p1715","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Bree longed to share the truth about her husband's painful betrayal, but sadly for Bree, admitting defeat was not an option.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1716","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Great. Everything is just great.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1717","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Ok, well, I got you the honey mustard dressing. The ranch looked just a little bit suspect.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1718","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"Are we going to talk about what I said?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1719","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"If you think I'm going to discuss the dissolution of my marriage in a place where the restrooms are labeled \"chicks\" and \"dudes\", you're out of your mind.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1720","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"What's in this?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1721","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"What do you mean, What's in this? It's salad.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1722","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"With onion. You put onion in my salad.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1723","e":"e01","p":"p17","t":"No, I didn't. Oh wait…","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1801","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"The sound that awakened my son was something he'd heard only once before. Many years ago when he was quite young.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1802","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"But he recognized it instantly. It was the sound of a family secret.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1803","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"7 days after my funeral, life on Wisteria Lane finally returned to normal, which, for some of my friends, was unfortunate.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1804","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Now what?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1805","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Daddy's home!","s":"son"},{"i":"e01p1806","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Come on! Hey, is anybody home?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1807","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"I wasn't expecting you for a week.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1808","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"I have to go back to Frisco in the morning. But I got your call. You sounded a little frazzled.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1809","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Yeah! It's been a little rough.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1810","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Hi, Yeah, Peaches.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1811","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Daddy, Did you buy us any presents?","s":"son"},{"i":"e01p1812","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Oh, god, presents. Wait up. Let me see.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1813","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"But I'm not giving it to you unless you promise me to go outside right now and practise throwing for 20 minutes, okay? You promise?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1814","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Get out! Who's open? Go out. Deeper. Deeper. Touchdown!","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1815","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"You gotta be kidding. I'm exhausted. I look terrible. I'm covered in peaches.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1816","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"I'm sorry, baby, I gotta have you.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1817","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Well, is it okay if I just lie here?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1818","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Absolutely.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1819","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Wait. I gotta tell you I was having trouble with swelling. So the doctor took me off the pill. You just gotta put on a condom.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1820","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"A condom? What's the big deal? Let's risk it.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e01p1821","e":"e01","p":"p18","t":"Let's risk it?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p1901","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"I can't believe you tried to kill me.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1902","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"Yes, well, I feel bad about that. I told you, Mrs. Huber came over and I got distracted. It was a mistake.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1903","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"Since when do you make mistakes?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1904","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"What's that supposed to mean?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1905","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"It means I'm sick of you being so damn perfect all the time.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1906","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"I'm sick of the bizarre way your hair doesn't move.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1907","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"I'm sick of you making our bed in the morning before I've even used the bathroom.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1908","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"You're the plastic suburban housewife with her pearls and spatula, who says things like \"we owe the Hendersons a dinner.\"","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1909","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"Where's the woman I fell in love with. Who used to burn the toast and drink milk out of the carton? and laugh?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1910","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"I need her, not this cold, perfect thing you've become.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e01p1911","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"These need water.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p1912","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"Bree sobbed quietly in the restroom for five minutes, but her husband never knew.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p1913","e":"e01","p":"p19","t":"Because when Bree finally emerged, she was perfect.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2001","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"I found my earrings. We can go now.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2002","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Was John here today?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p2003","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Well, yeah.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2004","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"The lawn hasn't been mowed. I've had it. We're getting a real gardener.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p2005","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Why?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2006","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Are you deaf? I just said he's not doing his job.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p2007","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"It's dark. You just can't see that the lawn has been mowed.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2008","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"It hasn't been. Feel this grass.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p2009","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"I'm not feeling the grass. Let's just get going. Come on, we're late.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2010","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"There's Tanaka. Time for me to go into my dance.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e01p2011","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Good luck, sweetheart. Excuse me. You see that man just walked away? Can you make sure he has a drink in his hand all night long.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2012","e":"e01","p":"p20","t":"Yes, Ma'am.","s":"valet"},{"i":"e01p2101","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Mrs. Huber, how are you doing?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2102","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Not too well, I'm afraid. I'm trying to find something to soothe my stomach.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2103","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"It's upset?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2104","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Yeah. I had the worst macaroni and cheese at the wake. It's been running through me ever since.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2105","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"And I need to be at my best. Eddie Britt's son is spending the night tonight.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2106","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"He's spending the night?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2107","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Apparently Eddie is having a gentleman friend over for dinner. And I think she plans on entertaining into the wee hours. if you know what I mean.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2108","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Oh, here's some antacid, have you ever tried this?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2109","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"I can't believe it. This can't be happening. Mike can't like Eddie better than me. He just can't.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2110","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"You don't know what's going on. Maybe they're just having dinner. You're right, they're doing it.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e01p2111","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Eddie? Hello? Anybody home? I need to borrow sugar.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2112","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"And just like that, the possibility Susan had clung to, the maybe of Mike Delfino, was gone forever.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2113","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"And despite the precariousness of her situation, Susan took a moment to mourn her loss.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2114","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"It didn't take Susan long to realize, this was just not her night.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2115","e":"e01","p":"p21","t":"Is somebody out there? Oh my god! That's smoke.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e01p2201","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"She left candles unattended in the den. The paramedic said she was lucky. She could've been killed.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e01p2202","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"She ran out with nothing on. She was having sex with some guy when the fire started.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2203","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"What happened to him?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2204","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"He got smoke inhalation. He's at the hospital.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2205","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"Susan, are you all right? You look awful.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p2206","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"I'm fine. I just feel really bad for Eddie.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2207","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"Oh, honey, don't worry about Eddie. She's a strong lady.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2208","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"Absolutely. She'll get through this. She'll find a way to survive.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2209","e":"e01","p":"p22","t":"We all do.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p2301","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"Wow! What happened?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p2302","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"And suddenly there he was, like a phoenix rising from the ashes.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2303","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"Mike! I thought you were... Where were you?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2304","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"I just got back from the movies. Eddie had a fire, huh?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p2305","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"Yeah, but she's fine now. Everything's fine now.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2306","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"And just like that, Susan was happy. Life was suddenly full of possibilities.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2307","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"Not to mention a few unexpected surprises.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2308","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"It's me.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p2309","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":"Do you have anything yet?","s":"Man"},{"i":"e01p2310","e":"e01","p":"p23","t":" But don't worry. I'm definitely getting closer.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e01p2401","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"I brought some champagne. I thought we should have a toast.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2402","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"The next day my friends came together to pack away my clothes, my personal belongings and what was left of my life.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2403","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"All right, ladies, lift'em up. To Mary Alice, a good friend and neighbor. Wherever you are, we hope you've found peace.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2404","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"To Mary Alice.","s":"Lynette/Gabrielle/Bree"},{"i":"e01p2405","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"Let's get the show on the road.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2406","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"You guys, check out Mary Alice's clothes. Size 8? Ha! She always told me she was a size 6. Guess we found the skeleton in her closet.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2407","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"Not quite, Gabrielle, not quite.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2408","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"What's that?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2409","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"It's a letter addressed to Mary Alice.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p2410","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"How ironic to have something I tried so desperately to keep secret treated so casually.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2411","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"What are you doing? That's private.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2412","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"It's open. What's the big deal?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2413","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"I know what you did. It makes me sick. I'm going to tell.","s":"Letter"},{"i":"e01p2414","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"What does this mean?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e01p2415","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"I don't know. But check out the postmark.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e01p2416","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"Oh, my god. She got it the day she died.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e01p2417","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"Do you think this is why she ... ?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e01p2418","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"I'm so sorry, girls. I never wanted you to be burdened with this.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e01p2419","e":"e01","p":"p24","t":"Oh, Mary Alice, what did you do?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0101","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"An odd thing happens when we die. Our senses vanish.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0102","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Taste, touch, smell, and sound become a distant memory, but our sight -- ah, our sight expands.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0103","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"And we can suddenly see the world we've left behind so clearly.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0104","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Of course, most of what's visible to the dead could also be seen by the living, if they only take the time to look.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0105","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Like my friend Gabrielle, I should have seen how unhappy she was, but I didn't.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0106","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"I only saw her clothes from Paris, and her platinum jewelry, and her brand-new diamond watch.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0107","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Had I looked closer, I’d have seen that Gabrielle was a drowning woman, desperately in search of a life raft.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0108","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Luckily for her, she found one. Of course, Gabrielle only saw her young gardener as a way to infuse her life with a little excitement.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0109","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"But now she was about to discover just how exciting her life could get.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0110","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Damn it. Come on! Hurry up! Let's go.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0111","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Where are the rest of my clothes?","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p0112","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"I'll find them. Just get out. Out the window. ... Hey, honey. You're home early.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0113","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"My meeting got canceled. Didn't you take a shower this morning?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0114","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"I just finished a workout.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0115","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Where's John? That's his truck out front.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0116","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Gabrielle was panicked. She knew if her husband discovered her secret, she would feel the full force of his wrath.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0117","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Hey, Mr. Solis.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p0118","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Hey, John, did you take care of that ficus yet?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0119","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"I'll get to it as soon as I'm done here.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p0120","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"Alright. We need to talk about the hedges later.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0121","e":"e02","p":"p01","t":"But she was quickly reminded that what Carlos couldn't see couldn't hurt her.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0201","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"The peaceful facade of Wisteria Lane had recently been shattered, first by my suicide, and then by the discovery of a note among my belongings that suggested a suspicious reason for my desperate act.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0202","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"My friends gathered to discuss its implications.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0203","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"I think we should give it to Paul.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0204","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"He's still mourning, Susan. He'll probably freak out.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0205","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"It doesn't matter. She was his wife. He deserves to have all the facts.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0206","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"Well, we could do it gently. We could tell him about it over coffee and pastry.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0207","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"That would be fun. \"Paul, we have proof your wife killed herself over some deep, dark secret. Another bear claw?\"","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0208","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"We could always call the police.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0209","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"Maybe it's just some sort of sick joke.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0210","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"Well, if it was a joke, it was in very poor taste.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0211","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"No, this was serious. I know it was. We got to find out what was going on.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0212","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"Let's say we do; there's a chance we're not going to like what we find.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0213","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"Well, isn't it worse to be in the dark? I mean, imagine she did all these horrible things.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0214","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"It's the age-old question. isn't it? How much do we really want to know about our neighbors?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0215","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"My friends were right to be concerned; they knew that every family has its secrets.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0216","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"And as my son and husband could have told them, you need to think carefully before digging them up.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0217","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"After talking for hours, my friends still hadn't agreed on what to do with the note.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0218","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"So they decided to talk about it in the morning after a good night's rest. But no one could fall asleep that night.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0219","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"They each kept thinking of my suicide and how terribly alone I must have felt. ","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0220","e":"e02","p":"p02","t":"You see, loneliness was something my friends understood all too well.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0301","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"It's okay. I'm up.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0302","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"Good. I have a question for you. Do you remember when you proposed?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0303","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"For God's sake.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0304","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"We sat on Skyline Drive and drank a bottle of apple wine.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0305","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"And when we finished it, you turned to me, and you said, \"If you marry me, Bree Mason, I promise to love you for the rest of my life.\"","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0306","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"And even though I was engaged to Ty Grant, and even though my father didn't like you, I said yes.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0307","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"That was a long time ago.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0308","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"You're going to cancel the meeting with that divorce lawyer, and we're going to find ourselves a marriage counselor.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0309","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"You promised.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0310","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"All right.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0311","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"Good. I'm going to make myself some warm milk. Would you like something to drink?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0312","e":"e02","p":"p03","t":"Anything but apple wine.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0401","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"Susan awoke that night alone and parched, but as she gazed out of her window, she saw the tall drink of water she needed to quench her thirst.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0402","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"\"Dear diary, Mike doesn't even know I'm alive.\"","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p0403","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"Shut up.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0404","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"If you want to date him, you're going to have to ask him out.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p0405","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"I keep hoping he'll ask me out.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0406","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"How's that going?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p0407","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"Shouldn't you be making brownies for your nerdy friends?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0408","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"I can't find the measuring cup. Have you seen it?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p0409","e":"e02","p":"p04","t":"The measuring cup? Well, it's got to be here somewhere. Just keep looking.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0501","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"I know you're awake.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0502","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"I know you're a jerk.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0503","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Dinner with Tanaka ran long. I'm sorry.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0504","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"You know, Carlos, I didn't marry you so I could have dinner by myself 6 times a week.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0505","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"You know how bored I was today? I came this close to actually cleaning the house.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0506","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Don't be that way. I got you a gift.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0507","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Nope. You're not going to buy your way out of this one.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0508","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"It's a good gift.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0509","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Is that white gold?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0510","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Yeah. Put it on and then make love to me.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0511","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"I'm not in the mood. But we could stay up and talk.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0512","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"When a man buys a woman expensive jewelry, there are many things he may want in return, for future reference, conversation ain't one of them.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0513","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Hey, that was a joke. What the hell is wrong with you?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0514","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Let go of me.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0515","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"You've been acting like a nightmare for a month. What's wrong? I can't fix it unless you tell me.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0516","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"It's not exciting anymore, Carlos.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0517","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"So what am I supposed to do?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0518","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"I don't know. Be the way you used to be. Surprise me. Take my breath away.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p0519","e":"e02","p":"p05","t":"Okay.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p0601","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"I didn't realize anybody was going to be out here. I just sort of rolled out of bed.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0602","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"I'm sure you look fine. Oh, Bongo, stop. Sorry, he scares easy.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0603","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"No, it's fine. I get it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0604","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"I didn't mean to disturb you. I'll see you later.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0605","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Do you want to have dinner with me?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0606","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Just the two of us?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0607","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Well, and Julie. It's a thing we do when somebody new moves into the neighborhood, we invite them over for a home-cooked meal. Sort of a tradition.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0608","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"I thought you said you were a lousy cook.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0609","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Well, I order takeout.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0610","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"You invite them over for home cooking and give them takeout?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0611","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Yeah, it's sort of a new tradition. I'm working out the kinks.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0612","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"I'll tell you what. How about I cook? And you guys come over to my place. Friday night at six?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p0613","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Oh, great. I'll be there. By, Bongo.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0614","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Julie!  Mike Delfino just invited us to dinner Friday night.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0615","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"He did? Cool.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p0616","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"But only I'm going because you're gonna come down with something semi-serious that requires bed rest and fluids.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p0617","e":"e02","p":"p06","t":"Julie was glad Susan was rekindling her love life. Of course, she was unaware of her mother's recent track record with fire.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0701","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"It's all gone. Everything my ex-husband worked for all those years gone.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p0702","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"Don't worry about clothing. I already started a collection from people in the neighborhood.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p0703","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"What? I don't want to wear other people's old crap.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p0704","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"Eddie, you can be homeless or you can be ungracious. You really can't afford to be both.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p0705","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"That reminds me. My insurance check still hasn't come yet. Could I stay with you a few more weeks?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p0706","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"Of course. What kind of Christian would I be if I denied shelter to a friend in need?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p0707","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"Oh, look. Here's something we can salvage. Your measuring cup. We can just scrape off the burnt part and it'll look good as new.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p0708","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"That's not my cup. Mine was plastic.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p0709","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"Well, how did it get in here?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p0710","e":"e02","p":"p07","t":"I don't know. Who cares? Now, could you put that down and start looking for jewelry?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p0801","e":"e02","p":"p08","t":"Dr. Albert Goldfine was the most accomplished marriage counselor in the city.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0802","e":"e02","p":"p08","t":"He had dealt with problems ranging from substance abuse to infidelity, to domestic violence.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0803","e":"e02","p":"p08","t":"Yes, Dr. Goldfine thought he had seen it all. And then he met the Van De Kamps.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0804","e":"e02","p":"p08","t":"Hi. I'm Bree. And this is my husband Rex. And I brought you some homemade potpourri.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p0805","e":"e02","p":"p08","t":"The answer is yes. You're about to make a fortune off us.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p0901","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"Boys! Guys, I'm begging you. Sit in your seats. I'm not gonna tell you again. Buckle up. I mean it, so help me... Oh, Crap!","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0902","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"License and registration, please. Ma'am, you know why I pulled you over?","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0903","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I have a theory.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0904","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"The kids are jumping up and down, they should be sitting, wearing seat belts.","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0905","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I yelled at them. They never listen to me. It's very frustrating.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0906","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"You’re gonna hafta find a way to control them. After all, that's your job.","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0907","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"Though he'd been a policeman for six years, officer Hayes had never found himself in a truly dangerous situation.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0908","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"Then again, he had never before told a woman how to raise her children.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p0909","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"Are you saying I'm a bad mother?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0910","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"Ma’am, you need to get back in your car please.","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0911","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I have no help. My husband's always away on business.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0912","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I'm gonna have to ask you to step back now.","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0913","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"My babysitter joined the witness relocation program.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0914","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I haven't slept through the night in six years and for you to stand there and judge me.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p0915","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"OK. I'm not gonna give you a ticket. I'm just gonna let you off with a warning.","s":"Officer"},{"i":"e02p0916","e":"e02","p":"p09","t":"I accept your apology.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1001","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Well, this is my room. Sorry about the mess.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1002","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Oh, don't worry about it.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1003","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"You just missed my mom. On Friday, she coaches my little sister's soccer team.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1004","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Yes, I heard that. John, we need to talk about what happened the other day.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1005","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Mr. Solis isn't starting to catch on, is he?","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1006","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"No, he doesn't have a clue, god love him. It's just I was thinking that when you come over to garden, you might actually have to garden.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1007","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Great, you're breaking up with me, in my own bedroom.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1008","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"No, I'm not dumping you. Lately, you've been the only thing keeping me going. It's just we can't do it at my house anymore.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1009","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Oh, so then, where do you want to do it?","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1010","e":"e02","p":"p10","t":"Well, what time does your mom get back from soccer practice? You better hurry, we don't have a lot of time.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1101","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"And so there are just the four of us. My older son, Andrew, is 16, Danielle is 15 and...","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1102","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"I don't need to see pictures. Bree, you've spent most of the hour engaging in small talk.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1103","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Oh, have I?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1104","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Yes, Rex has been very vocal about his issues. Don't you want to discuss your feelings about your marriage?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1105","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"This is the thing you got to know about Bree. She doesn't like to talk about her feelings. To be honest, it's hard to know if she has any.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p1106","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Does she feel anger, rage, ecstasy? Who knows? She's always pleasant, and I can't tell you how annoying that is.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p1107","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Whatever she feels is so far below the surface, no one can see it. I feel like she's using all these domestic things..","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p1108","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Bree? Would you like to respond to what Rex just said? ","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1109","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Is there some truth there? Do you use housework as a way to disengage emotionally?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1110","e":"e02","p":"p11","t":"Of course not!","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1201","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"This is great. I got tons of homework tonight. It's easier to concentrate after sex.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1202","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"I'm glad I could help. Education's very important.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1203","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"Oh, I got something for you. I was gonna give it to you next time I mowed your lawn, but since you're here.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1204","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"Oh, it's a rose.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1205","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"It's not just any rose. Look at all the petals, there are no flaws. It's perfect. Just like you.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1206","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"The truth hit her like a thunderbolt.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1207","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"I had spent days looking for just what I wanted. Finally found it.","s":"John"},{"i":"e02p1208","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"For John, this was no longer a meaningless little affair. Gabrielle could now clearly see he was falling in love with her.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1209","e":"e02","p":"p12","t":"It's just beautiful. I got to go.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1301","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Hey, you. What are we having?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1302","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"I talked to Julie and she suggested rib-eye steaks. She said that's your favorite.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1303","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"I love my steak.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1304","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Eddie, Hey, I'm sorry about your house. How you holding up?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1305","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"All right, I guess. Oh, is somebody having a party?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1306","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"No, Susan's just throwing me one of her traditional welcome-to-the-neighborhood dinners. Only I'm cooking, and having it at my house.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1307","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Traditional? I didn't get one.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1308","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Oh, it's sort of a new tradition.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1309","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"It won't be anything fancy. Just a little home cooking.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1310","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"That sounds so good. I've been having nothing but fast food lately.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1311","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Susan suddenly had an awful feeling in the pit of her stomach. ","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1312","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"As if she was watching an accident in slow motion. She knew it would happen, but was powerless to stop it.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1313","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Eddie, would you like to join us for dinner?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1314","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Oh, that's so sweet. No, I don't want to intrude, three's a crowd.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1315","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"No, it's not like that. I mean, Susan's bringing Julie.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1316","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"It's not like that. The more the merrier.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1317","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Well, this will be fun.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1318","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"All right, tomorrow night. We'll eat at six.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1319","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Great. Oh, Susan, this will make up for the dinner that you never threw me.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p1320","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Should I have told her we were having steak? She's not a vegetarian or something similar?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p1321","e":"e02","p":"p13","t":"Oh, no. Eddie's definitely a carnivore.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1401","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Here's what I pulled for Eddie. I should warn you that most of the clothes in there aren't that stylish.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1402","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Don't worry about it. Eddie's a beggar now, which means she can't be a chooser. Of course, we don't have to add salt to the wound.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1403","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Listen, I was just getting dinner ready...","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1404","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Say no more. I'll get out of your hair. By the way, was that you I saw getting pulled over by a policeman?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1405","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Yeah, the boys were acting up in the car, I couldn't get them to sit down.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1406","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Young boys can be so willful.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1407","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"I try everything. I scream, I threaten, I reason, I beg, nothing works.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1408","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"I don't know if it's because they're too young and they don't understand, or if they're just getting some perverse joy out of testing me.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1409","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"My mother used to have the worst time with me in the car, so one time when I was acting up, she stopped and left me on the side of the road, and she drove off.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1410","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"You're kidding.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1411","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Oh, she came back immediately, but I never misbehaved in the car again. You should try that.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1412","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Mrs. Huber, I could never leave my kids by the side of the road.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1413","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"When it comes to discipline, sometimes you must be creative. My mother knew that, smart lady.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1414","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Of course, she's in a home now, and her mind has just turned to mush.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1415","e":"e02","p":"p14","t":"Well, like I said, I should go back and get dinner ready.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p1501","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Susan, have you been able to find old clothes for Eddie? She has nothing to wear.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1502","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I thought that was the look she was going for.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1503","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Oh, Susan, Eddie may be trash, but she is still a human being.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1504","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Zach, is your dad home? I need to talk to him. Hi, Paul, I hope I'm not interrupting.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1505","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Actually, I was getting ready to go somewhere.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1506","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I just wanted to come by and say hello. You know, see how you guys are doing.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1507","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"We're trying to move on, it's been pretty tough.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1508","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I can only imagine, not knowing why Mary Alice...","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1509","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Why what?","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1510","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Why she did it. Oh, let me help you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1511","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I got it. I've got it.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1512","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I'm sorry if I upset you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1513","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Can I be frank?","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1514","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"Of course.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1515","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"I don't care what her reasons were. Maybe she was depressed, maybe she was bored, it doesn't matter.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1516","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"She abandoned her husband and her son, and I'll never forgive her.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e02p1517","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"As I watched Susan, I couldn't help feeling sorry for her. She wanted so much to know why I did it, why I killed myself.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1518","e":"e02","p":"p15","t":"It's not enough to want the truth, you must know where to look for it. And the truth is elusive, because it knows where to hide.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p1601","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"Hello, Julie. I talked to your mom about donating some clothes for Eddie.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1602","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"She's at Mrs. Van De Kamp's. But I'll see if she left some stuff upstairs.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p1603","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"Oh, Julie. I was just admiring your new measuring cup.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1604","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"Yeah, we lost ours.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p1605","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"Really?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1606","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"So I couldn't find the clothes, I'm sorry.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p1607","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"That's okay.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1608","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"If you want me to keep looking?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p1609","e":"e02","p":"p16","t":"No, you've done more than enough. Truly.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e02p1701","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Bree, Rex just called. He won't be able to meet you here today, apparently, there was an emergency at the hospital.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1702","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Oh, Well, I wish he'd called me.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1703","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"He suggested perhaps you'd like to meet with me by yourself? You've been very quiet in our joint sessions.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1704","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"What? No, thank you. I have some things that I need to do today.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1705","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Are you sure?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1706","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Yeah, I'm sure.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1707","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"OK.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1708","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Dr. Goldfine, there is something you can do for me.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1709","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"What's that?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1710","e":"e02","p":"p17","t":"Take off your coat.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1801","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"So now you're taking Julie on your dinner date with Mike?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1802","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Yeah, Well, if Eddie is gonna be there, I'm gonna need emotional support.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1803","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"I can't believe she wormed her way in. How did you let her do that?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1804","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"I don't know, I was gonna take her out at the knees, but it all happened so fast.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1805","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Well, you know what you need to do. You need to get there early, spend a little time with Mike before the little barracuda gets there.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1806","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"That's a good idea. Eddie will get there at 5:45, which means her breasts will arrive at 5:30, so I should shoot for 5:00.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1807","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"That a girl. I'm just gonna take these upstairs.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1808","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"I'm gonna keep my one little bag and go home. That is a beautiful rose, Where did you get it?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1809","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Oh, John gave it to me.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1810","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"John? Your gardener, he gave you a rose?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1811","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Yes, I am having some new bushes planted outside, and he gave me that as a color palette.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1812","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Oh, OK, sure is beautiful, isn't it?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p1813","e":"e02","p":"p18","t":"Yes, it is.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p1901","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"I'm sure Freud would not approve of this.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1902","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"Oh, who cares what he thinks? I took psychology in college, we learned all about Freud, a miserable human being.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1903","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"What makes you say that?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1904","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"Well, think about it, he grew up in the late 1800s, there were no appliances back then.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1905","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"His mother had to do everything by hand, just backbreaking work from sunup to sundown, not to mention the countless other sacrifices she probably had to make to take care of her family.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1906","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"And what does he do? He grows up and becomes famous, peddling a theory that the problems of most adults can be traced back to something awful their mother had done.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1907","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"She must've felt so betrayed. He saw how hard she worked, he saw what she did for him, did he even ever think to say thank you? I doubt it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1908","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"There you go.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p1909","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"Just so you know, many of Freud's theories have been discredited.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p1910","e":"e02","p":"p19","t":"Good.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p2001","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"boys, I am not gonna tell you again, sit. I mean it, I am serious. You guys are gonna be in so much trouble if you don't sit back in those seats.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2002","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"For the first time, Lynette could see this was not the innocent play of children, she was being challenged. So she decided it was time to get creative.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2003","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Out! You can't behave? You heard me, you cannot ride. you, out, move it.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2004","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Where is she going?","s":"Children"},{"i":"e02p2005","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"OK, mommy is a genius, five, six, all right. Uh, mommy will be right back.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2006","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Boys? If you're hiding, you've got to stop now, 'cause mommy doesn't think it's funny.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2007","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Oh, excuse me. I'm sorry, I'm looking for my boys, three boys with red hair, have you seen them?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2008","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Yeah, I also saw you drive away and leave them.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2009","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I know，I was just trying to scare them into behaving, did you see where they went?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2010","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Yeah, they're in my kitchen, listen, it seems to me that you have some anger management issues.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2011","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I have four kids under the age of six, I absolutely have anger management issues.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2012","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I think you need to talk to somebody because abandoning your children.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2013","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I didn't abandon them, I came back.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2014","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I'm just saying it's not normal.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2015","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Well. my kids aren't normal, and now I don't have time for this, lady. So, boys, get out here.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2016","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"I don't think they should go anywhere until you calm down.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2017","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Get in the car.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2018","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"She's got cookies.","s":"Children"},{"i":"e02p2019","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Well, bring them, we're leaving.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2020","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"No, stay put.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2021","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Oh, I don't think so.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2022","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Listen, lady, you and I are gonna talk.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2023","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Leave my mommy alone.","s":"Children"},{"i":"e02p2024","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Let go of me. What's the matter with you? Run, boys, run! Come on! Oh, crap.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2025","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"Boys, you're gonna need to put on your...","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e02p2026","e":"e02","p":"p20","t":"You get back here. Get back or I'm gonna call social services.","s":"Lady"},{"i":"e02p2101","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"Oh my god, Carlos, what have you done?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p2102","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"I saw it when I drove by dealership, I thought Gabrielle would look so beautiful in this. Cost me an arm and a leg.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p2103","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"It's got GPS navigation, 200 watt stereo system, rear parking sensors.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p2104","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"God, it's beautiful.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p2105","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"So did I take your breath away?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p2106","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"Absolutely.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e02p2107","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"Is it the best gift you've ever gotten?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e02p2108","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"Gabrielle could see what this gesture had cost Carlos, so she responded the only way she knew how.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2109","e":"e02","p":"p21","t":"She had a feeling the truth would've been lost on her husband anyway. After all, it's the rare man who understands the value of a single perfect rose.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2201","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"I hope you don't mind, I thought I'd come by early and help you set up.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2202","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"Hey, Susan, don't worry, Mike and I have got everything under control.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2203","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"Bongo! I don't know why he barks at you.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2204","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"I wouldn't take it personally； dogs are very sensitive.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2205","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"What's up, Bongo? You never know what freaks them out, huh?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2206","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"In the distance, Susan thought she heard a bell ring.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2207","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"Is it a strange noise? What is it? A weird smell?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2208","e":"e02","p":"p22","t":"Round one had started.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2301","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"Look, all I'm saying is that this whole it takes two to mess up a marriage theory is bull; the problems that we have are because of her.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p2302","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"That is not true, Rex.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e02p2303","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"All right, fine. What I have been doing for the past 20 years has been so awful?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p2304","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"You're not saying anything because I've been a great husband, and it kills you to admit that.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e02p2305","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"Rex, I'm curious, do you ever acknowledge the benefits of living with Bree?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p2306","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"By your own admission, your home's always clean; your clothes are always freshly pressed; she sounds like a wonderful cook.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p2307","e":"e02","p":"p23","t":"Despite her flaws, do you ever remember to say thank you?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e02p2401","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Bongo! Get down! Down! I'm sorry. So who's the guy that lives across from Mrs. Huber again?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2402","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"That's Mr. Mullen. And just so you know, if he invites you in, you have to meet all of his pets.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2403","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"That's OK, I love animals.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2404","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"He is a taxidermist.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2405","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Oh, OK, thanks for the warning.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2406","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Isn't Mr. Mullen's brother your divorce attorney?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2407","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Yes, he was.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2408","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Can I say something? In my heart, I still believe that you and Carl are gonna get back together.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2409","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Really?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2410","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Oh, yeah. I've never seen two people more in love. I mean, she's never gonna find that kind of chemistry with another man, never.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2411","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"It was everything Susan could do to keep a smile on her face, round two was under way, and she was already taking a beating.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2412","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"What Eddie hadn’t counted on was that Susan had someone else in her corner.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2413","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"You know what, Mrs. Britt? Do you know who I always liked? Mr. Rothwell, your fourth husband.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p2414","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"He was my second husband, I've only been married twice.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2415","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"Twice? You weren't married to the guy with all the tattoos that they took away in handcuffs?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p2416","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"No, Julie, she wasn't married to Javier; that was just one of her special friends.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2417","e":"e02","p":"p24","t":"I think we should change the subject. You know, unless you want to keep talking about it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2501","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Bongo, get down.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2502","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Wait, let me show you something.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2503","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"He loves that gravy.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2504","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Come, while you were in there tossing a salad, I taught him something.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2505","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Susan was furious with Eddie for using a dog to ingratiate herself with its owner.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2506","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"She was also furious with Mike for not seeing through this blatant maneuver.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2507","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"But mostly she was furious with herself for not having thought of it first.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2508","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"so, you know what? I'm gonna go get the desserts.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2509","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"You are such a smart boy!","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2510","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"I can barely get him to sit. I've never seen him walk on two legs.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2511","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"He knows who to come to, doesn’t he?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2512","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Here's your dessert.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2513","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Thank you, Mike, this looks yummy.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2514","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Oh, look at that, it’s like Bongo's finally warming up to Susan.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2515","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Oh, we just got off on the wrong foot; we're best buddies now. Oh, what a good boy! Bongo, are you OK?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2516","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"What's wrong with him?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2517","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"I don't know, I never heard him make that sound. Are you OK, fella?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2518","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Mom? Where is your earring?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e02p2519","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Call the vet, the number's on the fridge, tell him I'll be right there.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2520","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"OK, don't worry about a thing. I'll stay here and get everything cleaned up.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e02p2521","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Thanks, Eddie.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2522","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"Is there anything I can do?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2523","e":"e02","p":"p25","t":"No.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2601","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"How's Bongo doing?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2602","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"I'm waiting to see if they'll have to operate.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2603","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Oh, god. I stopped and I got this for... I'm just so sorry for this.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2604","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"I'm really sorry I snapped at you. I just...","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2605","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Oh, no, it's OK.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2606","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Good news, we won't have to do surgery.","s":"Vet"},{"i":"e02p2607","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Oh, that's great.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2608","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"We've given Bongo something to help pass the earring. When he does, would you like us to retrieve it for you?","s":"Vet"},{"i":"e02p2609","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"I'm gonna say no.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2610","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"OK, you should be able to take him home in about an hour.","s":"Vet"},{"i":"e02p2611","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Wow, You must be so relieved.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2612","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"I'm sorry, I was just really worried.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2613","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"It was your dog, I get it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2614","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Actually, he was my wife's dog, and one of the last things she said to me in the hospital before she died was to be sure I looked after him, and I promised her I would.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2615","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"And just like that, Susan could suddenly see something she'd never seen before. Mike Delfino was still in love with his late wife.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2616","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"He meant so much to her. And if something had happened, I would've felt like I'd failed her. I know that sounds stupid, but...","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e02p2617","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"And she knew right then neither she nor Eddie would be laying claim to his heart anytime soon.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2618","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"So she decided, for now, she could settle for just being his friend.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2619","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"No, it doesn't, not at all. This is for you, well, for Bongo, you give it to him.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e02p2620","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"Yes, as I look back at the world I left behind, it's all so clear to me, the beauty that waits to be unveiled, the mysteries that long to be uncovered.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e02p2621","e":"e02","p":"p26","t":"But people so rarely stop to take a look, they just keep moving. It's a shame, really, there's so much to see.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0101","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"After I died, I began to surrender the parts of myself that were no longer necessary.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0102","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"My desires, beliefs, ambitions, doubts - every trace of my humanity was discarded.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0103","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"I discovered when moving through eternity, it helps to travel lightly.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0104","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"In fact, I held on to only one thing -- my memory.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0105","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"It's astonishing to look back on the world I left behind, I remember it all, every single detail.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0106","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Like my friend Bree Van de Kamp, I remember the easy confidence of her smile, the gentle elegance of her hands, the refined warmth of her voice.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0107","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"But what I remember most about Bree was the look of fear in her eyes.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0108","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Bree had started to realize her world was unraveling, and for a woman who despised loose ends, that was unacceptable.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0109","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Rex, You need to get up.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0110","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"It's not even light out.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0111","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Please hurry, if the kids see you sleeping down here, they're going to start asking questions.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0112","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Let them ask, I don't care anymore.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0113","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Well, I care, they don't need to be burdened with our marital problems while we're working things out. The least we can do is try to keep up appearances.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0114","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Yeah, appearances, I keep forgetting about appearances.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0115","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Oh, Rex, you look so tired.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0116","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"I didn't sleep, this damn thing is so uncomfortable.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0117","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Well, why don't you move back upstairs and sleep in our bed?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0118","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"We're in marriage counseling, Bree, I think that would confuse things.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0119","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"It's just I miss you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0120","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"I know you do.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0121","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Of course, if I find I can't start getting some sleep pretty soon, I'll be forced to move back upstairs out of sheer exhaustion.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0122","e":"e03","p":"p01","t":"Yes, Bree was afraid of many things, but if there was one thing she wasn't afraid of -- it was a challenge.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0201","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"The day on Wisteria Lane began like any other, with a cup of coffee and the morning paper.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0202","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"And while Lynette read the business section, and Gabrielle studied the fall collections, and Bree searched for decorating ideas, Susan scanned the front page and saw something that caught her eye.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0203","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Well, it's about time!","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0204","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Be nice, I come bearing snacks.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0205","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Lynette, these cards are sticky.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0206","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"I know, Preston used three diamonds to scoop jam out of the jar.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0207","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Gorgeous, thankful we have 49 cards to play with.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0208","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Hello, sorry I'm late.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0209","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"So, Susan, I was just telling the girls I want to throw a dinner party.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0210","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Really?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0211","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Yes, how long have we all lived on this street, we've never done a big group thing.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0212","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"I think it's a great idea.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0213","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Paul never likes to have people over, but the heck with him, I'm doing it.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0214","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"So, when is this shindig?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0215","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"How about a month from tonight? That would be the 16th, good for everyone?","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0216","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Works for me, should we all make something?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0217","e":"e03","p":"p02","t":"Oh no, this is my party, I've been wanting to have everyone over for years. I'm so happy we're finally doing this, it's gonna be so much fun.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p0301","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Hey, I know, her dinner.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0302","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"How could we have all forgotten about this?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0303","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"We didn't exactly forget, it's just usually when the hostess dies the party is off.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0304","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I'm not being flip, I'm just pointing out a reality.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0305","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Mary Alice was so excited about it, it's so sad.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0306","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I think we should go through with it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0307","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Really? Wouldn't that be in poor taste?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0308","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"No, it's sort of a way to honor Mary Alice, it was so important to her.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0309","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"We could all use a fun night.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0310","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Well, good, because I have some new flour that I've just been dying to show off.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0311","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I'm in.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0312","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I'll make braised lamb shanks.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0313","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I'm still in.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0314","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"So how many will I be cooking for?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0315","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Seven, three couples and Susan, does that sound right?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0316","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"No, it sounds very, very wrong.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0317","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"Is there somebody you'd like to invite?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0318","e":"e03","p":"p03","t":"I have an idea.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0401","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"A dinner party? Honey, I may be working late. The Dillman proposal is a complete mess.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p0402","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"No, you promised to be home every night this week.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0403","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"I'll try but I can't guarantee anything, this is business.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p0404","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"Says the prince as he rides off into the sunset. Boy, the movies ever get that wrong!","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0405","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"You know what your problem is? You're very tense, you should go to a spa or go shopping, find a way to relax.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p0406","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"Where are you?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0407","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"Algebra.","s":"John"},{"i":"e03p0408","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"Are you free at 4:00?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0409","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"I'm not sure, I’ve got track after school.","s":"John"},{"i":"e03p0410","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"Well, get here as fast as you can, my husband says I need to relax.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0411","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"You want me to keep my gym clothes on like last time?","s":"John"},{"i":"e03p0412","e":"e03","p":"p04","t":"If you would, please.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0501","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"A dinner party?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0502","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Yeah, it'll be fun. Bree's cooking, everyone's coming.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0503","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"You know what? I haven't even had a chance to unpack yet, honey, I just need to chill out for the next few days.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0504","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Oh, Tom, there will be liquor and hors d'oeuvres and grownups without children and silverware, remember silverware?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0505","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Honey, can you take this in for me?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0506","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Have you heard anything I just said?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0507","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Yeah, I'm sorry, I just, I'm wiped out. Three cities in six days, my head is just pounding, I'm not ready for a dinner party.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0508","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"I already got a sitter.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0509","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Can you cancel her?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0510","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"Please! Look, let's just stay in tomorrow night, we can get a bottle of wine and rent a video, and I just want to hang out with my best gal. That's all.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0511","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"I was looking so forward to a night out.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p0512","e":"e03","p":"p05","t":"I know, sweetie, I'm sorry, but I'm beat. I mean, do you remember what it was like to work a 60-hour week?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p0601","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"A dinner party? Do I have to go?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0602","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Well, given that we're hosting it, I'd say so. By the way, you won't be drinking at this party.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0603","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Why is that?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0604","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Because when you drink, you get chatty. No one needs to know that we're seeing Dr. Goldfine.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0605","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"You know, if you spend half as much time working on our problems as you do covering them...","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0606","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Not a drop.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0607","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"You know, this is ridiculous. And this whole thing about us taking tennis lessons?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0608","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Well, the nurses at your office may start wondering why you're disappearing three times a week.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0609","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Tennis lessons are a plausible alibi.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0610","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"So these tennis lessons we're taking, how are we doing?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0611","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"My backhand's improving immensely, but you're still having problems with your serve.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p0612","e":"e03","p":"p06","t":"Of course.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p0701","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"A dinner party?","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0702","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"It's tomorrow night, so if you could just keep Julie an extra day.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0703","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Fine, but that's all, Brandi and I leave Sunday for a week up at the cabin.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0704","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"What cabin?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0705","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Brandi wanted some place where we could get away. Escrow just closed yesterday.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0706","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"You can afford a cabin, but you can't scrape up child support?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0707","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"The check is in the mail.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0708","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Oh, no, it's not.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0709","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"I found my dental guard, I'm ready. Stop fighting.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e03p0710","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"We are being as nice as we possibly can to one another.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0711","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Like I said, stop fighting.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e03p0712","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Excuse me, Brandi, do you mind?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0713","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Oh, OK.","s":"Brandi"},{"i":"e03p0714","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Wait, Susan, you're right there, you can pick it up.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0715","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"I could, but she's the one who threw it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0716","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Come on, don't be petulant, just pick up the stupid can.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0717","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"No.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0718","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"I can pick it up.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e03p0719","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Honey, stay out of this.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0720","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Fine, this is so typical.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0721","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Oh, I'm sorry, was that petulant, too?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0722","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"You know what? You pick up the damn can yourself.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p0723","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"Yeah, well, you just go to hell.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p0724","e":"e03","p":"p07","t":"You want me to pick it up?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p0801","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"Mrs. Warmington said she looked for mom's obituary and couldn't find it. Did you put one in?","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p0802","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"I've had other things on my mind, Zack.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p0803","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"But how could you not do that? People are going to think we didn't care about her.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p0804","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"I doubt people will give it much thought, don't worry about it.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p0805","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"You never talk about her.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p0806","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"She hasn't even been dead a month and it's like you've totally forgotten she ever existed.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p0807","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"It's a little early for this kind of talk.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p0808","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"Maybe when you die, I won't put in an obituary.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p0809","e":"e03","p":"p08","t":"That will be your choice to make, assuming you outlive me.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p0901","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Mom, it's no big deal. Carlos and I are driving in for the baptism, problem solved.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0902","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"OK, fine, you go with aunt Maria, and I will take Nana to church.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0903","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Take your clothes off.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0904","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"OK, I got to go, mom, yes, right now, OK, you can give me directions later, bye.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0905","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Hi, How was school?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0906","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Got an A-minus on my biology exam.","s":"John"},{"i":"e03p0907","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Well, let's see what you've learned.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p0908","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"Who's that?","s":"John"},{"i":"e03p0909","e":"e03","p":"p09","t":"I don't know. Hey, you!","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1001","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"So did Mike say anything?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1002","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"No, but god, you should have seen the look on his face.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1003","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"I'm sure it's not that bad, I mean, he's coming to the party, right?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1004","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"I left three messages. Oh, he's not going to come, big surprise.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1005","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"I did everything but foam at the mouth, god, I hate when I get that way.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1006","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"It's like every time I get within 10 feet of Carl, I just become this monster.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1007","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"You know what? It's not going to change until you resolve your issues with that man.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1008","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"What? You mean forgive them?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1009","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"You know, I've lived with this bitterness so long, I think I'd be lonely without it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1010","e":"e03","p":"p10","t":"Honey, get a pet, see ya.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1101","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"It's a business meeting.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1102","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"It's a frat party.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1103","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Regional manager, corporate manager, head of sales.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1104","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Margarita, cigar, sombrero.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1105","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Honey, what do you want me to do? Sit around in the hotel the whole time watching cable?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1106","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"No, but when I say we've been invited to a party, don't whine about your exhausting 60-hour week. Put on your dancing shoes and take the mother of your children out for a good time.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1107","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Fine, you know what? You're right. Let's go to that party.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1108","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"I can't, I already canceled the sitter.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1109","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"OK, we'll throw the next one.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1110","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Throw a dinner party? I don't even have time to wash my face. No, you know what? I'm gonna go to this one, you can stay home and babysit the kids.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1111","e":"e03","p":"p11","t":"Fine, I can handle that.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1201","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"Gabrielle spent her morning searching for the mysterious little girl. Sadly for her, the mystery was solved a bit too quickly.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1202","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"Hey, what's going on?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1203","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"Have you met Ashley? Babe, this is Sheila Bukowski, our new neighbor, they just moved into the Miller's old house.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p1204","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"My daughter left her ball in your yard, I'm so sorry.","s":"Sheila"},{"i":"e03p1205","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"No, no problem. Nice to meet you, Ashley.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1206","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"She's shy, she doesn't say much.","s":"Sheila"},{"i":"e03p1207","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"Yeah, but I can see her little mind working away.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p1208","e":"e03","p":"p12","t":"Nice meeting you. Come on, Ashley.","s":"Sheila"},{"i":"e03p1301","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"Private sessions? I don't understand. Why do we need private sessions?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1302","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"Private sessions allow us to work on the personal issues of both partners.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p1303","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"I don't have any personal issues, my only issue is that my husband wants to leave me, and how can I work on that if he is not in the room?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1304","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"There are things I need to discuss with Dr. Goldfine, and I can't have you here.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p1305","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"Why? I'm your wife. You can say anything in front of me. All we need is a few more sessions, and I'm sure we can...","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1306","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"Damn it, Bree, a few more sessions is not gonna fix us. This is bigger than that.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p1307","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"Why don't we do it this way? Rex, you can take the first half-hour. Bree, you can take the second.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p1308","e":"e03","p":"p13","t":"And doctor, if what he is about to discuss has anything to do with adultery, prostitution, or internet pornography, I would really appreciate you taking a moral hard line.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1401","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"Hey, Ashley, remember me? We met earlier.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1402","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"Wow, aren't you the little artist? What are those, flamingos?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1403","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"No.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1404","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"What a very pretty! It almost looks like they are kissing.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1405","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"Funny thing about kissing, it's not just for husbands and wives. Sometimes we kiss our mom or our grandpa. Sometimes we even kiss our dog. Sometimes we even kiss people who are just our friends, kind of like a high-five on the lips, right?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1406","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"Hey, Ash, I was at the mall and I saw this, I thought you might like it. She is Hawaiian, her name is princess Kahalua, and I think it means \"little waterfall\" or \"big pond\" or something.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1407","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"OK, so we are good, right? Well, you enjoy your new little friend, and if there's anything else you need, you just let me know.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1408","e":"e03","p":"p14","t":"What I'd really like is a bike.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1501","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Where did you find that?","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p1502","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"She used this to kill herself, why would you keep it?","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1503","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Because I thought we might need it someday.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p1504","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"For what?","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1505","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Protection.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p1506","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"I want to talk about mom.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1507","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"You need to take your medication.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p1508","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Hello, Zack, I hope this is not a bad time.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1509","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"What can I do for you, Mrs. Van de Kamp?","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1510","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Well, I wanted to invite you and your father to a dinner party tomorrow night.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1511","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"I'm not sure where he is right now.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1512","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Well, I'm sorry it's such late notice, but well, we weren't sure that you and your father were ready for any kind of social engagement yet.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1513","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"But we're sort of throwing it in your mother's honor.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1514","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Really?","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1515","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Yes, it's gonna be a casual night with the gang, we're going to eat and tell fun stories about your mom. Zack, are you OK?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1516","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Hello, Bree. I heard, thank you, but we already have plans for tomorrow.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e03p1517","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Oh, that's too bad, well, I should go.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1518","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Thank you, Mrs. Van de Kamp.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1519","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"For what, Zack?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p1520","e":"e03","p":"p15","t":"Remembering my mom.","s":"Zack"},{"i":"e03p1601","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"That night, Paul gave his son something to calm his nerves.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1602","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"And the next day, Gabrielle calmed her own nerves by giving something to her new best friend.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1603","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"Here you go! Top of the line, 3-speed, aluminum frame, handlebar ribbons, and a bell.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1604","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"And you'll notice it's royal blue to match your pretty little eyes.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1605","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"My eyes are green.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1606","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"Yeah, well, you'll be cruising so fast on this, no one will even notice. It's all yours, hon, have fun. What, what's wrong?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1607","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"I don't know how to ride a bike.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1608","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"What? Then why did you ask for one?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1609","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"Why can't you show me?","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1610","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"Well, sure, one of these days.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1611","e":"e03","p":"p16","t":"What's wrong with now?","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1701","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"After her talk with Lynette, Susan decided to take a look at her old photo album.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1702","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"And she began to see herself in a whole new light, and the picture wasn't flattering.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1703","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"Yeah, you've got Carl, leave a message.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p1704","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"Hey, Carl, it's me. I was hoping you would be there.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1705","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"Listen, we need to talk, so maybe when you drop Julie off tomorrow, we could have a moment. It's important, give my best to Brandi, call me.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p1706","e":"e03","p":"p17","t":"Susan was proud of herself, she was finally ready to let go of her anger, well, almost.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p1801","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"The boys will be hungry at 5:30, so put the fish sticks in the toaster oven at 5 o'clock.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1802","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"For half an hour, honey, I know, this is the third time you've told me.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1803","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"Well, if the food's late, god help you.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1804","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"Beautiful, I don't need a pamphlet. It's not brain surgery, they're just kids, for god's sake.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p1805","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"Preston, would you come here? Sweetie, you know our rule about eating cookies, right?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1806","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"Yeah, we can't have them after 5:00, 'cause sugar makes us hyper.","s":"Preston"},{"i":"e03p1807","e":"e03","p":"p18","t":"Yeah, but tonight, anything goes. Make sure you share with your brothers.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p1901","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"Don't look at your feet, look at the road, find your balance, it's all you, you're doing great. Stay to the right, watch the car! Are you OK?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1902","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"Yeah, let's go again.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1903","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"Honey, these heels don't have another block in them.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1904","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"What about tomorrow?","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1905","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"You won't be around tomorrow, 'cause you have school.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p1906","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"I'm homeschooled, I'm always around.","s":"Ashley"},{"i":"e03p1907","e":"e03","p":"p19","t":"It was in that moment that Gabrielle realized this ride was far from over.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p2001","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I'm coming, Carl, what are you doing here? I asked you to come tomorrow.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2002","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"You said you wanted to talk, it sounded important.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2003","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"Tomorrow, I'm in a towel.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2004","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"We were married for 14 years. I know what's under there. Come on.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2005","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I'm not really ready for this. I was gonna have a whole speech prepared.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2006","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"Brandi and I have plans tomorrow, I suggest you wing it.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2007","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"OK, here's the thing, Carl, I was thinking about what happened in the driveway yesterday.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2008","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I don't want to live like that, I don't want to be that kind of person, and I just thought if the two of us, you know, if we had a nice, calm... I need an apology, Carl.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2009","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"What?","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2010","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"An apology, for the way you ended our marriage, you never took any responsibility for your behavior.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2011","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I don't know what to say, Susan, the heart wants what it wants.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2012","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"What does that mean?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2013","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I fell in love.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2014","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"While you were married to someone else.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2015","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"The heart wants what it wants.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2016","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"My heart wants to hurt you, but I can control myself.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2017","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I don't want to go back to that ugly place, really, and if you do, I suggest that you get some help.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2018","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"You know what? I don't need an apology, I don't need anything from you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2019","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"You're humiliating yourself.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p2020","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"No, you're the one who's been humiliated, why don't you see that?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2021","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"You walked out on your family, people think you're scum, not me, so worry about yourself.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2022","e":"e03","p":"p20","t":"I'm OK with me, I can walk down the street and hold my head high.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2101","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"As the sun slowly settled on Wisteria Lane, an unsettled Susan racked her brain to find a way into her own house.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p2102","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"Lying naked in her shrubs, it occurred to Susan this could be the most humiliating moment of her life -- she was wrong.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p2103","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"Susan? Whatcha doing?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2104","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"Locked myself out naked. And then I fell. So how are you?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2105","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"Good, I just got back, I've been gone all day, and I got your messages about dinner, and I would love to come if that invite still stands.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2106","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"It's a date.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2107","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"All right, I assume the dress is casual.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2108","e":"e03","p":"p21","t":"Yeah, it's casual.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2201","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Thanks for helping me break in, do you think it'll be hard to replace that screen?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2202","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"It depends, if you nail it yourself, you might want to wear gloves or pants, pants wouldn't hurt.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2203","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"OK, I know what just happened is funny in theory, but I'm nowhere near ready to laugh about it, so please, no jokes.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2204","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Hey, where have you two been?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2205","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Susan had a problem finding something to wear. Oh, is that the kind of thing you meant?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2206","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Pretty much.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2207","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"The kids are bouncing off the walls? I'm sure you can figure out a way to put them to bed, Tom. I mean for god's sake, Tom, they're just kids.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2208","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Hey, are you OK?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2209","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Yeah, I went jogging today, and I think I just pushed myself too hard.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p2210","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Oh, you were probably not wearing the right shoes.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2211","e":"e03","p":"p22","t":"Yeah, that thought did cross my mind.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p2301","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"So Gabrielle says that you and Bree are taking lessons three times a week. I'm actually thinking about playing again. I mean, it's such great exercise.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2302","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"Mm, that it is.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2303","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"And my drop shot could use a serious tune up. Think you can give me the number of your pro?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2304","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"Yeah, I'll give it to you later.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2305","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"Well, what club does he work out of?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2306","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"We are not really taking tennis lessons, Carlos.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2307","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"You're not?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2308","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"That's a story Bree concocted to cover the fact that we're seeing a marriage counselor.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2309","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"Bree, he wouldn't stop asking about the tennis pro.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2310","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"Bree and I are in marriage counseling. Everyone knows our secret now. Did the sky fall? Has your life come crashing down?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2311","e":"e03","p":"p23","t":"If everybody would please take your seats, dinner is served.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2401","e":"e03","p":"p24","t":"With the winds from the northwest at 4 miles per hour, it's currently 55 degrees.","s":"Reporter1"},{"i":"e03p2402","e":"e03","p":"p24","t":"Now we go to Rich, live on the scene in Westbrook.","s":"Reporter2"},{"i":"e03p2403","e":"e03","p":"p24","t":"A grisly discovery was made today in Westbrook when a chest was found in Rockwater Lake, discovered by a local area businessman and his grandson while they were fishing.","s":"Reporter3"},{"i":"e03p2404","e":"e03","p":"p24","t":"Investigators recovered a wooden chest containing what appears to be human remains.","s":"Reporter3"},{"i":"e03p2405","e":"e03","p":"p24","t":"Now, a police spokesman says the body was ...","s":"Reporter3"},{"i":"e03p2501","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"OK, I got to break the ice here. So you're in counseling, big deal. You want humiliation? I'll give you humiliation.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2502","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"I locked myself out of my house stark naked and got caught by Mike.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2503","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"Oh my god, when did this happen?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p2504","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"Today, right before the party.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2505","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"What can I say, right place right time.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2506","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"I think I can top that. Try getting thrown out of Disneyland for lewd behavior.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2507","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"What? When was this?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2508","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"When Tom and I were first married, things got a little out of hand on Mr. Toad's Wild Ride.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2509","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"You're kidding.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2510","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"No, we got perp walked down Main Street, USA.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2511","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"Well, since we're doing true confessions, Carlos and I once broke a waterbed in Cancun.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p2512","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"How did you manage that?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2513","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"Well, he used to have a thing for spiked heels.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e03p2514","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"I'd just like to make it clear -- she was wearing them.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2515","e":"e03","p":"p25","t":"Rex cries after he ejaculates.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2601","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"You think we left too early?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2602","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"I was thinking we left too late.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2603","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"So, is Rex gone for good?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2604","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"I don't know, god I hope not. I mean, they've always been wound a little tight, but I've never seen them like that. Then again, who am I to judge?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2605","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"You mean people who live in glass houses shouldn't throw soda cans?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2606","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"OK, you've got to know that I only get that angry around Carl, he just treated me so badly at the end. I haven't been able to get past it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2607","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"Maybe he did you a big favor.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2608","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"What do you mean?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2609","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"Let's look at Carl as a starter marriage, you know, boot camp, preparing you for something better next time.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2610","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"Listen, Mike, about the whole seeing me naked thing, I just want to thank you for being such a perfect gentleman.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2611","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"Oh, I wasn't a perfect gentleman, I might have snuck a peek.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2612","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"Oh, good night.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p2613","e":"e03","p":"p26","t":"And for what it's worth, Wow.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e03p2701","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"How was your night?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2702","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"We are raising little terrorists. You know that, don't you?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2703","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Oh, you didn't have a good time?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2704","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"You know what? Drop the act, I know you gave them cookies.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2705","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Oh, who cracked, anyway?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2706","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Porter. So how was your dinner party?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2707","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Well, there was dinner, but it wasn't much of a party.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2708","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Oh, what happened?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2709","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"I don't know, Rex announced that he and Bree are in counseling.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2710","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"She retaliated with this whole revelation which I won't even go into now, and the bottom line is he stormed out.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2711","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Clearly, there's trouble in paradise.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2712","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Honestly, I'm not that surprised.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2713","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Why not?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2714","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"I don't know, I just never got the idea that they were really happy.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p2715","e":"e03","p":"p27","t":"Are we happy?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p2801","e":"e03","p":"p28","t":"Man, oh, man, I keep seeing that look on Rex's face, and then him taking off like that.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2802","e":"e03","p":"p28","t":"Some night.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2803","e":"e03","p":"p28","t":"Then again, I would probably cry, too, if I had to have sex with that woman.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2804","e":"e03","p":"p28","t":"I mean, you watch a man get torn down like that, it makes you wonder why he let her get away with it.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2805","e":"e03","p":"p28","t":"Believe me, if a woman ever humiliated me like that in public, Hm, it would only happen once.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e03p2901","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"So where are you going?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2902","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"I'll be staying at the motor lodge.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2903","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"The hotel by the interstate has better rates, and it's closer to your work.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2904","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Fine.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2905","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"I'm packing your swimsuit. There's a pool there, and I know how swimming relaxes you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2906","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"When our kids ask where I am, what are you gonna say?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2907","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"I could tell them that you went to a tennis camp, that was a joke.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2908","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Yeah, I got it.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2909","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Obviously, if you've forgotten anything, you can come right back and get it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2910","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Well, I'll call you.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p2911","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Rex, in college, when we first started dating, people were so jealous of us.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2912","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"We were the golden couple, everybody knew we were going to have this wonderful life. Why is this happening?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p2913","e":"e03","p":"p29","t":"Because you can't even let me pack my own suitcase.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e03p3001","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Where are you going?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e03p3002","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Just a sec. Don't worry, I'm not packing heat. Hey, Brandi, would you scoot a little? Just scoot, thank you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p3003","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"What are you doing?","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p3004","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"I'll be quick. Brandi, I'm sorry for the way I treated you. It was uncalled-for and childish, and it won't happen again.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p3005","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"I have built up a lot of anger towards you, both of you. And I realize now that I just can't carry that around anymore, so apology or no apology, I'm moving on.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p3006","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Brandi, get in the car.","s":"Carl"},{"i":"e03p3007","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Mrs. Mayer.","s":"Brandi"},{"i":"e03p3008","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Please, call me Susan.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p3009","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"I just wanted you to know what happened between me and Carl, things got out of hand, because I thought your marriage was over. Anyway, I just wanted you to know I'm sorry, I really am.","s":"Brandi"},{"i":"e03p3010","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"Thank you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e03p3011","e":"e03","p":"p30","t":"And though it came from an unexpected source, Susan finally got the apology she'd always wanted.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p3101","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Hey, let me take those.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3102","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"You're wearing a really big hat.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3103","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Yes, I am. Listen, the kids are watching a video, which means that we've got only about 45 minutes until they actually find Nemo. So I suggest that we make the most of it.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3104","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"By reliving your night out with the guys?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3105","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Lynette, I'm trying.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3106","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"You look ridiculous in that thing.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3107","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Sexy ridiculous?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3108","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Maybe.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3109","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"I can live with maybe.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3110","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"You know, it's gonna take more than just this one night.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3111","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"I know. Looks like we have an audience.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e03p3112","e":"e03","p":"p31","t":"Let them look, as long as they don't try and cut in.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e03p3201","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Bree, we're not scheduled now, are we?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3202","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I didn't have time to make an appointment. Rex moved out today.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3203","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I'm very sorry to hear that, but unfortunately, I'm completely booked right now.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3204","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I don't need much time, it just seems that you have more insight into my situation than I do, and I just think...","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3205","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"We can't talk now.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3206","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"If you could just tell me what he told you, then I could fix the problem.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3207","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I can't do that, it's completely unethical.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3208","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Why can't you ...","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3209","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"That's my next appointment, you really need to go.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3210","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Dr. Goldfine, please.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3211","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Hold on, I'll go and talk to my client.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3212","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Bree searched for Rex's audiotape hoping to find answers, she found answers alright, but to entirely different questions.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p3213","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I understand completely, I'll be out in just a minute.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3214","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Bree, I'm sorry, he can't wait. But I can see you first thing in the morning, eight o'clock.","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e03p3215","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Eight o'clock, sorry to interrupt, bye.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e03p3216","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"Yes, I remember the world -- every detail, and what I remember most is how afraid I was. What a waste.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p3217","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"You see, to live in fear is not to live at all.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p3218","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I wish I could tell this to those I left behind, but would it do any good? Probably not.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e03p3219","e":"e03","p":"p32","t":"I understand now, there will always be those who face their fears, and there will always be those who run away.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0101","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"Previously on Desperate Housewives:","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0102","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"Susan played with fire and could get burned; Gabrielle found herself a playmate; Lynette couldn't get her kids to stop playing; and Bree played hardball. Everyone has a little dirty laundry.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0103","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"When I was alive I maintained many different identities, lover, wife and ultimately victim.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0104","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"Yes, labels are important to the living, they dictate how people see themselves.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0105","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"Like my friend Lynette, she used to see herself as a career woman, and a hugely successful one at that.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0106","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"She was known for her power lunches, her eye-catching presentations, and her ruthlessness in wiping out the competition.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0107","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"But Lynette gave up her career to assume a new label, the incredibly satisfying role of full-time mother.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0108","e":"e04","p":"p01","t":"Scavo residence. Yes, this is me.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0201","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"But unfortunately for Lynette, this new label frequently fell short of what was advertised.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0202","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"How in the world did they ...?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0203","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"I left the door to the art supply cupboard open for five minutes, that's all, five minutes.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0204","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"The little girl, why didn't she say anything?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0205","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"Your boys work quickly.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0206","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"Well, obviously, they will be punished for this, severely.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0207","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"I hesitate in bringing this up, since you got so ugly about it last time.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0208","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"They don't have attention deficit disorder, and I'm not gonna drug my boys just to make your job easier, I'd rather change teachers.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0209","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"The boys are in my class, because I'm the only teacher who can handle them.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0210","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"What if we separate the twins, put them in different classes? They're much calmer when they're not bouncing off one another.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0211","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"We can try that. But if it doesn't work, we may no longer be able to accommodate them.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0212","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"It suddenly occurred to Lynette, her label was about to change yet again.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0213","e":"e04","p":"p02","t":"And for the next few years, she would be known as the mother of the boys who painted Tiffany Axelrod blue.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0301","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"It looked to be an interesting afternoon on Wisteria Lane, a mysterious cassette tape had been discovered by my friend Bree.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0302","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"She had stolen it from her marriage counselor, a counselor I'd once spoken to in strictest confidence.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0303","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"So how have you been?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e04p0304","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"I had the nightmare again.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0305","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"It's weird to hear Mary Alice.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0306","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Still the same one?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e04p0307","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Yes, but this time I was standing in a river and I saw the girl under the water and she kept screaming 'Angela' over and over again.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0308","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"So what do you think the significance of the name 'Angela' is?","s":"Dr. Goldfine"},{"i":"e04p0309","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Actually, that's my real name.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0310","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Her real name? That doesn't make any sense, I've seen her driver's license, it did not say 'Angela'.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0311","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Bree, what does it say on the rest of the tape?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0312","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Just more about her nightmares, and this girl she was afraid of.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p0313","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"So what the hell do we do now?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0314","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"I think we should show Paul the note.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0315","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Are you sure? He's gonna freak.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0316","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Well, it's now or never, I mean I saw what he's asking for the place, it's gonna sell quickly.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p0317","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Can I say something? I'm glad Paul is moving. I'm sorry, he's just always given me the creeps.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0318","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Haven't you guys noticed he has this dark thing going on. Is there something about him that just feels...","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0319","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"Malignant?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0320","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"We've all sort of felt it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0321","e":"e04","p":"p03","t":"That being said, I do love what he's done with that lawn.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p0401","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"Mom, the dish is clean. I still don't understand why you don't just ask him out on an 'official date' date.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p0402","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"I'm trying a new strategy, I'm playing hard to get.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0403","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"How long do you think you can keep that up?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p0404","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"Maybe until noon. Then I'm going to have to run over there and beg him to love me.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0405","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"Mom, I don't think you're gonna be able to wait that long.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p0406","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"You gotta be kidding, she washed her car yesterday. Oh no, she's not. Yep, she's bringing out the big guns.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0407","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"You'd better get over there, she's wearing cotton.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p0408","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"What am I supposed to say to Mike? I saw you half-naked and I thought I'd drop by? What's that?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0409","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"A piece of Mike's junk mail we got by mistake, I held on to it in case of an emergency.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p0410","e":"e04","p":"p04","t":"God bless you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0501","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"We got this by mistake. I hope it's not important.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0502","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"No, it's just a promotion from the Rialto, they're having a film festival.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p0503","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"Well, I guess I've done my good deed for the day. I'll just head back home. Bye.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0504","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"Hey, do you like old movies?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p0505","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"I love old movies.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p0506","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"I hate Susan Mayer. Every time I see those big doe eyes of hers, I swear to god I just want to go out and shoot a deer.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p0507","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"What has she done this time?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p0508","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"She is out there throwing herself at Mike Delfino, again.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p0509","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"Susan likes Mike?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p0510","e":"e04","p":"p05","t":"Where the hell have you been, Martha? She has been lusting after him ever since he moved in.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p0601","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"I got your message, what's going on?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0602","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"The boys refuse to be separated.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0603","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"They refuse? They're six years old, make them.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0604","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"The school regulations are pretty strict about me wrestling with the boys.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0605","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"But if you want to give it a shot, be my guest.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0606","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"Fine. Which one goes and which one stays?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p0607","e":"e04","p":"p06","t":"You pick.","s":"Teacher"},{"i":"e04p0701","e":"e04","p":"p07","t":"I love taking baths, especially with you. It's like taking a vacation from the world.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0702","e":"e04","p":"p07","t":"I hated taking baths when I was a kid. Of course, back then, the only thing I had to play with was my rubber ducky. Who's that? It's Mr. Solis.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p0703","e":"e04","p":"p07","t":"Relax, Carlos is at work and he doesn't ring the doorbell. It's the cable guy, he's three hours late, use the side entrance.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0704","e":"e04","p":"p07","t":"Gabrielle knew her vacation from the world had ended. What she didn't know was John had left behind a souvenir.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p0801","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"I'm telling you Dad didn't come home last night. They had a fight, a bad one.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p0802","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"How bad?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p0803","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"Like divorce court bad. Listen to her, she always overcompensates when she's worried.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p0804","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"If dad moves out and leaves us with her, I'll lose my mind.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p0805","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"Dinner is on the table.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p0806","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"Mom, where did dad go last night?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p0807","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"He got a last minute call to speak at a medical conference in Philadelphia. Take your seats.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p0808","e":"e04","p":"p08","t":"This marriage is so over.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p0901","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"Again sorry I was late, the scheduler overbooked me.","s":"Cable guy"},{"i":"e04p0902","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"How long are you going to be?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0903","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"Almost done, what is that scent? Is that sage and citrus? It's amazing.","s":"Cable guy"},{"i":"e04p0904","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"Try to hurry, I have stuff to do.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0905","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"What's happening?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p0906","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"The cable guy fell, he hit his head on the tub, he may have a concussion.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p0907","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"It's almost eight.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p0908","e":"e04","p":"p09","t":"He was late.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1001","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Hello, Susan, I made you a pie.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1002","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Wow, why?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1003","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Do I need a motive to do something nice? I can't wait for you to try this, it's mincemeat.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1004","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Actually, I just had dinner.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1005","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"That's OK, you can save it for later.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1006","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"What's so funny?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1007","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I was just thinking of that expression, \"I'll make mincemeat out of you\".","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1008","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Mincemeat used to be an entree made up of mostly chopped meat, so it was like saying, \"I'll chop you up into little bits\". But that was centuries ago.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1009","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Today, mincemeat is mostly made up of fruit, spices and rum, there's no meat in it and still people say, \"I'll make mincemeat out of you\".","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1010","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I don't know that people really say that anymore.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1011","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I do. So, Susan, how are you?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1012","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I'm fine.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1013","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Good, you know, I have a confession to make. I've always wished I'd been more supportive when Carl left you.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1014","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Oh, you don't have to apologize about Carl, really, Carl and I are over, I've moved on.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1015","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Yes, I know. You've moved on to that nice Mike Delfino. He is quite a catch, isn't he? You like him, don't you?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1016","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Sure, as a friend.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1017","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Oh, Susan, being coy is a strategy best employed by virgins at their first dance. For women of our age, it's just annoying. Are you sure you don't want pie?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1018","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"No, thank you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1019","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I hope it works out with you and Mike, you've been so desperate to land him.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1020","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I'm not desperate.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1021","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Good lord, Susan, you burned your rival's house down, if that isn't desperate, I don't know what is.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1022","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Mrs. Huber, with all due respect, you're crazy. What's that?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1023","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"I think you recognize it. I found it in the ruins of Eddie's home.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1024","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Well, that's not ...","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1025","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"My point is this, I wasn't there for you when Carl left, but I'm here for you now.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1026","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"As far as I'm concerned, this is our secret, and no one ever need know.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1027","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"Oh, Susan, you don't know how good it feels to finally be able to help you.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1028","e":"e04","p":"p10","t":"You look so pale, now, I insist you try some of my pie. Go on. Did I mention it's mincemeat?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1101","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Open the door, please.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1102","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Hang on. What?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1103","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"May I come in?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1104","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"No.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1105","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"I want to talk to you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1106","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Then talk.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1107","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Where were you last night?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1108","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Brian's.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1109","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"I just spoke to Brian's mother, now tell me again where you were last night and this time don't lie to me.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1110","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Where did you say dad was again? In Philadelphia?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1111","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Andrew, don't change the subject.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1112","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"I'm sorry, I thought this subject was telling lies. I called Dad's cellphone, I know he moved out.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1113","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Well, it's just temporary and... I thought it would upset you so I was protecting you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1114","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Whatever, you lied, so stop pretending like you have some sort of moral authority.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1115","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"Andrew, just because I chose not to share my marital problems with you does not give you the right to be rude.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1116","e":"e04","p":"p11","t":"How about driving my father away? Do I get to be rude then?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1201","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"What's this?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p1202","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"It's a sock.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1203","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"It's a man's sock. I found it under our bed. It's not mine.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p1204","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"Oh, for god's sake, Carlos, it's Yao Lin's.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1205","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"Our maid wears size 13 gym socks?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p1206","e":"e04","p":"p12","t":"No, she dusts with them. See? Socks instead of rags.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1301","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Susan, hello, did you and Mike come together? I saw him over in the fresh produce aisle.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1302","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"No, like I told you before, we’re just friends.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1303","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"By the way, if I didn’t make it clear yesterday, I absolutely did not do that thing you accuse me of.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1304","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Nice to see you, Mike.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1305","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Hey, you like Alfred Hitchcock? They’re doing a retrospective down at the Rialto.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p1306","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Uh, I’m not really a fan.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1307","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Come on, how can you not like Hitchcock?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p1308","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"I just, uh, don’t.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1309","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Oh, OK. Well, nice to see you. You too, Mrs. Huber.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p1310","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"You’re so silly, pretending not to like him on my account. I mean, really.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1311","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Will you just drop it?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1312","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"You shouldn’t be rude to me, Susan. Your secret is not an easy burden to bear.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1313","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"That insurance company is putting Eddie through hell. But still, I’ve said nothing.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1314","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"The longer it takes for her to get payment, the longer she’ll be staying with me, eating me out of house and home, using up my hot water.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1315","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"What exactly is it you want from me, Mrs. Huber?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1316","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Are these together?","s":"Cashier"},{"i":"e04p1317","e":"e04","p":"p13","t":"Ring it up.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1401","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"If the school and the pediatrician both think the twins could stand to be medicated, then what’s the problem?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1402","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"I used to run a company with 85 people, and now I can’t wrangle three small boys without doping them?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1403","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"Talk about feeling like a failure.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1404","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"Lynette, you’re a great mother. But, let’s face it, your kids are a challenge.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1405","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"Thank you. That’s the nicest way you could’ve said that.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1406","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"You know, the truth is, when they’re not making me want to tear my hair out, they’re actually really sweet.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1407","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"I’m afraid if I change the bad stuff, I’m going to change the good stuff.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1408","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"It’s a tough call.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1409","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"Like this mug, I love this mug. If I medicate them, are they still going to make me a mug like this?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1410","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"You know it’s leaking.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1411","e":"e04","p":"p14","t":"Yeah, I know.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1501","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"We talked to Paul, we told him we need to show him something.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1502","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"He is on his way over.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1503","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"So Paul, we notice that you’re selling the house.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1504","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"Yes, too many painful memories, I’m sure you understand.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p1505","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"Before you move, we thought there’s something you should know.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1506","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"It seems there may be more to Mary Alice’s death than you are aware of.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p1507","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"Remember when you asked us to pack her things? Well, when we did, we found a note.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1508","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"And we think that you should have it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1509","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"You can see from the postmark, Mary Alice probably got it the day she died. Paul, are you going to be okay?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1510","e":"e04","p":"p15","t":"No.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p1601","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Have you always cleaned with socks?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p1602","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Yes.","s":"Yao Lin"},{"i":"e04p1603","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"What is that, a Japanese thing?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p1604","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"I’m Chinese. I don’t like lying.","s":"Yao Lin"},{"i":"e04p1605","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Well, I don’t like your ironing, so there.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1606","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Mrs. Solis, what are you doing here?","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p1607","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Carlos found this under the bed.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1608","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Oh, crap.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p1609","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"It’s OK. It was a close call, but I managed to cover.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1610","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"I got you these. So from now on, we can’t let Carlos see you around the house wearing anything resembling a gym sock.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1611","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"You want me to mow your lawn in sandals, I could lose a toe.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p1612","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Imagine what you’d lose if Carlos finds out you’re trimming more than the hedges.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1613","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"Why are your friends staring at me? Did you tell them about us?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p1614","e":"e04","p":"p16","t":"No, they’re staring ‘cause they think you’re hot.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p1701","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"It’s 9:30. What is your brother thinking?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1702","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"Want my advice? Call dad. go tell him to kick Andrew’s ass.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p1703","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"I am perfectly capable of handling this without your father. Where’s your cellphone? Call Andrew and find out where he is.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1704","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"Mom, he is gonna know you are behind this.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p1705","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"No, he won’t. Just act normal.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1706","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"Hey, it’s me. What’s going on? He knows.","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p1707","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"Andrew, this is your mother. I am rapidly reaching the end of my patience with you.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1708","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"Where are you? Are you at a bar? Andrew! He hung up on me.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1709","e":"e04","p":"p17","t":"What are you gonna do?","s":"Danielle"},{"i":"e04p1801","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Heath, Lan, Andrew.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1802","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Mom, how did you even know I was here? You went in my room?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1803","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"You think that’s bad? Tomorrow morning I’m cleaning it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1804","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"By the way, Heath, I didn’t get a chance to tell you, that was a lovely solo last week at church.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1805","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Thank you, we’re out of here.","s":"Heath"},{"i":"e04p1806","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"I hope it wasn’t something I said. Well, Andrew, shall we?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1807","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"You just humiliated me in front of my friends. I’m not going anywhere with you.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1808","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Fine.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1809","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"What are you doing?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1810","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"I’m staying for the show. I’m dying to see what all the fuss is about.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1811","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Excuse me, waitress, I’ll have a glass of your house Chardonnay.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1812","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"I’m curious, Andrew. As you fantasize about this woman, do you ever stop and think how she came to be on this runway?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1813","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"That’s someone’s little girl, and that someone probably had a lot of dreams for her, dreams that did not include a thong and a pole.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1814","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"It’s not gonna work, OK? I’m not budging.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p1815","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"God only knows what she’s had to deal with in life. Abject poverty, drugs, domestic violence, maybe even molestation.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1816","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"Now she treats herself the way other men treat her. Like an object, a piece of meat.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p1817","e":"e04","p":"p18","t":"That does it. Kid, get her out of here. She’s killing it for the rest of us.","s":"Man"},{"i":"e04p1901","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"We’re not here, leave a message.","s":"Phone message"},{"i":"e04p1902","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"It’s Mrs. Huber, Susan, are you there? I can see your lights are on. I hope you’re not screening, That’s so tacky.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1903","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Listen, I need to talk to you. My water heater just burst, and it’s gonna cost me $600 to get a new one, and I can’t afford that.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1904","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"I’m just beside myself, call me as soon as you get in.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p1905","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Julie, honey, wake up. We need to talk.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1906","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Can’t this wait until morning?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p1907","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"I think I’m being blackmailed...","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1908","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"And when I realized I couldn’t put out the fire, I ran. I must’ve dropped the measuring cup in the process.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1909","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Why do I even let you out of the house?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p1910","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Obviously, I can’t let her get away with this. The only thing to do is go to the police and tell them what happened.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1911","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"You can’t do that.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p1912","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Julie, I don’t think they’ll throw me in jail. I mean, it was an accident.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p1913","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"Dad won’t care if it was an accident. You know he’ll just use this as an excuse to reopen custody. Mom, I don’t want to live with Dad.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p1914","e":"e04","p":"p19","t":"I know.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2001","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"I need to talk to you.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2002","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Cool, sure.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p2003","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"You were working Tuesday, right? Do you remember the cable guy showing up? And you usually work till what time, five?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2004","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Yeah.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p2005","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Damn it. That means he was in the house for four hours.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2006","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Wait, now that I think about it. I might not have seen him.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p2007","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Either you saw him or you didn’t, which is it?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2008","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"I didn’t.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p2009","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"John, did my wife ask you to lie for her?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2010","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Mr. Solis, I really don’t want to get in the middle of anything.","s":"John"},{"i":"e04p2011","e":"e04","p":"p20","t":"Thank you, that’s all I needed to know.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2101","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"OK, let’s run through it one more time.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2102","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Mom, it’s not brain surgery. You’ll stand guard while I crawl through Mrs. Huber’s doggie door. Once inside, I’ll find the measuring cup. Simple.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p2103","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Oh, god, I hate that I’m turning you into a little thief.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2104","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"It’s our measuring cup. We’re just taking back what’s ours.","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e04p2105","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Hey, that’s right. Ethically, we have nothing to be ashamed about. Oh, wear these, I don’t want you to leave fingerprint.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2106","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"There she goes, okay, move.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2107","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Oh, so glad to be playing Frisbee again. Here you go, coming atcha.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2108","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"All right, back up a little more, there you go.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2109","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Wow, all right, here we go.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2110","e":"e04","p":"p21","t":"Oh, my, whoops! You'd better go get that.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2201","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"Hey, Susan, I thought that was you.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2202","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"Yeah, Julie and I are just out tossing a Frisbee around, and it flew off into Mrs. Huber’s backyard.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2203","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"Oh, you need some help?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2204","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"No, Julie’s got it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2205","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"OK, actually, I’m glad I ran into you. I wanted to make sure things were OK between us. The other day, you seemed kind of distant.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2206","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"Distant? What do you mean?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2207","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"I mean, you’re not mad at me for some reason, are you?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2208","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"No, not at all.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2209","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"Good, ‘cause I’m gonna take one more shot at this. I got tickets for a Billy Wilder retrospective, Wednesday night, I’d love to take you with me.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2210","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"You are so sweet. I’d love to go.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2211","e":"e04","p":"p22","t":"All right.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2301","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Eddie, I thought you’d be at work.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2302","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"I’m not feeling well. I got a sunburn the other day washing my car.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2303","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Well, don’t just run off, come and hang out with us.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2304","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Boy, you are one sick ticket.","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2305","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"What?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2306","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"It’s not bad enough I have to watch you throw yourself at him every day. And now you want to make sure that I see it up close and personal?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2307","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"No, it’s not like that.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2308","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"I’ve got to take off, but I’ll call you about Wednesday night, OK?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2309","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Eddie, wait. Mike and I were gonna go see the movies on Wednesday and I just thought it would be fun if you joined us.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2310","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"You want me to come with you?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2311","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Yeah. That’s OK, isn’t it, Mike?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2312","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Well, it’s a limited engagement. But it’s sold out, I’ve only got two tickets.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2313","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Eddie, wait. You should take my ticket.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2314","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Really? Is that OK with you, Mike?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2315","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"Uh, yeah, sure.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e04p2316","e":"e04","p":"p23","t":"So what time do you want to pick me up?","s":"Eddie"},{"i":"e04p2401","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"Hang on.","s":"Cable guy"},{"i":"e04p2402","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"You think you can have sex with anyone you want, huh?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2403","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"Carlos couldn’t help but feel proud of himself. After all, he’d just defended his honor, or had he?","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p2404","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"Are you gay?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2405","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"Yes, Is that why you’re doing this?","s":"Cable guy"},{"i":"e04p2406","e":"e04","p":"p24","t":"Yeah.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2501","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Will you buy some chocolates?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2502","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Ladies.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2503","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Hey, Paul, what’s up?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2504","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"I wanted to apologize for my outburst yesterday.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2505","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Don’t worry about it. We unloaded a lot on you.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2506","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"I suppose you’re wondering why I reacted so violently to that note.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2507","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"It did cross our minds.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p2508","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Well, the truth is, Mary Alice was not a well person. She was very troubled.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2509","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"At first it was harmless. She would leave herself notes, reminders like “pick up the milk” or “Zach has a dentist appointment.”","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2510","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"But over time the notes became ugly. Hateful messages started showing up. Mary Alice was writing them to me, to Zach, to herself.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2511","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Really.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p2512","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"That’s why I lost it. I was reminded of what Zach and I had been through.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2513","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Paul, I’m so sorry.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2514","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"We had no idea.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p2515","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Well, anyway, I’d appreciate it if you kept this to yourselves. For Zach’s sake.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p2516","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Of course.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2517","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"Wow, I think he’s lying.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p2518","e":"e04","p":"p25","t":"So do I.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2601","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Scavo Promoted to Vice President. What next for whiz kid Lynette Scavo.","s":"News"},{"i":"e04p2602","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Boys, could you get in here, please?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2603","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"He broke my plane.","s":"Twins1"},{"i":"e04p2604","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"I did not.","s":"Twins2"},{"i":"e04p2605","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"We’ll talk about that later. Right now I need you to take some medicine.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2606","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Are we sick?","s":"Twins1"},{"i":"e04p2607","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Not exactly, this is a kind of special medicine. It’s like a vitamin and you’ll take it every day. OK? Stay right there. Now open up.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p2608","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Nope.","s":"Twins"},{"i":"e04p2609","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"In that moment, Lynette made a decision. When it came to dealing with her children, medication was no longer an option.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p2610","e":"e04","p":"p26","t":"Of course, given her continuing level of frustration, Lynette also felt a little “self-medication” couldn’t hurt.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p2701","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"So what’s your strategy? Are you just never gonna speak to me again?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2702","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Something like that.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p2703","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"I suppose I do owe you an apology.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2704","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Careful, I wouldn’t want you to strain yourself.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p2705","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"I shouldn’t have lied to you about your father. You and your sister are old enough to handle the truth, and I’m sorry.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2706","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Keep going. I’m mad at you for about 7000 other things.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p2707","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"If you think I’m gonna apologize for taking you out of a strip club, you’re wrong. I consider it one of my finest moments.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2708","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Oh, Andrew. I know you blame me for what’s happening with your father, but it’s not entirely my fault and I need you to understand that.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2709","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"I do. I just don’t want him to leave.","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p2710","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Neither do I.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2711","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Mom, when can I have my door back?","s":"Andrew"},{"i":"e04p2712","e":"e04","p":"p27","t":"Three months.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p2801","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"Royal Oaks was the scene of a hate crime today, when Jonathan Lisco, local gay activist and part-time female impersonator, was brutally attacked in his home.","s":"Reporter"},{"i":"e04p2802","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"Lisco speculated the attack was in response to his efforts to secure same-sex partner insurance coverage from his employer, Cliffside Cable.","s":"Reporter"},{"i":"e04p2803","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"Police are circulating this sketch of the assailant.","s":"Reporter"},{"i":"e04p2804","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"The circumstances speak for themselves. I’ve taken a strong stance with my company.","s":"Lisco"},{"i":"e04p2805","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"Is there something you want to ask me?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e04p2806","e":"e04","p":"p28","t":"No.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p2901","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"You took it, didn’t you?","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2902","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"Good evening, Mrs. Huber.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2903","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"It’s my own fault for not hiding the cup. Obviously, if you‘re capable of arson, I should have known that you’d be capable of breaking and entering.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2904","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"I don’t know what you’re talking about, Mrs. Huber.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2905","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"I suppose you destroyed it.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2906","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"Again, I don’t know what you’re talking about. But, yeah, I did.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2907","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"I was going to keep your secret, It’s a shame you couldn’t trust me.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2908","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"You are a piece of work, do you know that?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2909","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"Oh, Susan, let’s not be unpleasant. We can go back to the same friendly relationship we’ve always had.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2910","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"I will keep my lawn looking nice. And I will make sure that my music isn’t played too loud. And if I get some of your mail, heck, I’ll run it right over. Because that’s what good neighbors do.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2911","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"But from now on, when I run into you on the street, and I say, “Good morning, Mrs. Huber” or “How are you, Mrs. Huber?”, just know that inside, I’m quietly but decidedly hating your guts.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p2912","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"Careful, dear. Let’s not say things we’ll live to regret.","s":"Huber"},{"i":"e04p2913","e":"e04","p":"p29","t":"Good evening, Mrs. Huber.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p3001","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"He actually said Mary Alice was crazy?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p3002","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"Not in so many words, but everything Paul said certainly made it seem like she was schizophrenic.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p3003","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"I think he’s hiding something. I know it.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e04p3004","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"But wait. What about the tape? I mean, she did say that her name was Angela.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p3005","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"Mary Alice was not crazy.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e04p3006","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"My father was a prosecutor and he always said that the simplest explanation was usually the right one.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e04p3007","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"But remember what the note said: “I know what you did. It makes me sick. And I’m going to tell.”","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p3008","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"That’s not the kind of thing that someone writes to themselves. That’s a message sent by an enemy.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e04p3009","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"So exactly what is it you hired me to do?","s":"Man"},{"i":"e04p3010","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"It’s very simple really. Someone sent that note to my wife, and I need to know who.","s":"Paul"},{"i":"e04p3011","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"What type of person would send such a note? Was it an enemy? Of course.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e04p3012","e":"e04","p":"p30","t":"But what kind? An acquaintance? A stranger? Or how about a neighbor that lives a few feet away?","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0101","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Ultimatums were made, questions were asked, and lots of evidence was uncovered. Talk about dirty laundry.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0102","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Every neighborhood has a woman like Albert Frome, and every woman like Mrs. Frome has a cat.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0103","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"When she traveled, Mrs. Frome would arrange for friends to look after her beloved pet.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0104","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"This time, however, she was forced to ask her neighbor, Susan Mayer.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0105","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Mrs. Frome liked Susan, but it was common knowledge on Wisteria Lane, where Susan Mayer went, bad luck was sure to follow.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0106","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Her misfortunes ranged from the commonplace to the unusual, to the truly bizarre.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0107","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"As she waved goodbye, she worried that Susan’s streak of bad luck would continue. For that matter, so did her cat.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0108","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Mr. Whiskers, dinner time. Here, kitty. That’s weird, cats can’t open drawers, can they?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0109","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Are you sure you didn’t leave them open this morning?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e05p0110","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"No way.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0111","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Wow, do you think somebody broke in?","s":"Julie"},{"i":"e05p0112","e":"e05","p":"p01","t":"Though she didn’t know it at the time, Susan’s luck had finally started to change.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0201","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"News that an intruder had breached the security of Wisteria Lane spread like wildfire.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0202","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"At a neighborhood watch meeting the next night, residents voiced their concerns over the increasing dangers their community faced.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0203","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Mrs. Ida Greenberg announced someone was looking through her bathroom window whenever she took a shower.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0204","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Bob Fisk warned those present that an unnamed government agency was listening in on their phone conversations.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0205","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Helen Vale spoke of a ruthless local teenage gang that had egged her minivan.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0206","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"There are three factors that contribute to ...","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0207","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"The evening concluded with Officer Thompson offering safety tips and a plan of action.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0208","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"That is the opportunity that you have some control over, so you can sign up for either daily or nightly patrols.","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0209","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"I know that might seem like overkill, but I guarantee regular surveillance will deter even the most determined criminal.","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0210","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"So are there any other questions? Alright then, let's be careful out there.","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0211","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Actually, I do have a question, do you have a second?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0212","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Sure, how can I help?","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0213","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Um, I'm the one who discovered the break-in, and I think I found some evidence.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0214","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Evidence?","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0215","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"I think this is a screwdriver left behind by the burglar, and I didn't touch it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0216","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Why didn't you give this to the investigating officers?","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0217","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"I tried and they sort of laughed at me. Because apparently nothing was taken from Mrs. Frome's house.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0218","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Well, I apologize for that, that was totally unprofessional.","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0219","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Thank you. So do you think it should be dusted for prints?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0220","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Yes, and I'll make sure it gets done.","s":"Policeman"},{"i":"e05p0221","e":"e05","p":"p02","t":"Great, bye.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0301","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"So why weren’t you sitting with Mike tonight? I thought you two were becoming an item.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0302","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"I sort of thought so too. Getting a lot of mixed signals.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0303","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"I'll tell you who wasn’t giving mixed signals, was that sexy Officer Thompson. He was staring at you all night.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0304","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"You notice that?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0305","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Honey, trust me, when they’re not staring at me, I notice.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0306","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"I really do appreciate you guys staying and helping.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0307","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Oh, please, I would have hosted it myself, but the kids are going to the mountains tomorrow, and there’s camping equipment everywhere.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0308","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"It’s nice of you. And since we’re talking, there’s something else nice that I’d like you to do. Your kids both went to Barcliff Academy, didn’t they?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0309","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Yes.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0310","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"We need you to recommend Porter and Preston. We can’t even get an interview.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0311","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Oh, you want me to recommend the twins?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0312","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Yes, you can tell them how beautifully behaved the boys are.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0313","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"So you want me to lie?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0314","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Yeah, I thought that was understood.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0315","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Well, it’s just that I’m very respected at Barcliff, and my word won’t be good there anymore.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0316","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Yes, but by the time they realize their mistake, we’ll be in. You’re not having any more kids. What do you care?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0317","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Well, I had hoped someday to get my grandchildren into Barcliff. But I suppose that doesn’t matter to you, does it?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0318","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"It really doesn’t.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0319","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Paul and Zach are fighting again.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0320","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"That’s the second time this week. They never used to fight like that when Mary Alice was alive.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0321","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"It’s a shame. They used to be such a happy family.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0322","e":"e05","p":"p03","t":"Just because you didn’t hear them fighting doesn’t mean they were happy.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0401","e":"e05","p":"p04","t":"The next day, as residents began to patrol Wisteria Lane in the hopes of foiling potential burglars, Gabrielle was about to experience a home invasion of her own.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0402","e":"e05","p":"p04","t":"Mom Solis, what are you doing here?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0403","e":"e05","p":"p04","t":"I came to visit my son and daughter-in-law. What does it look like?","s":"Mom Solis"},{"i":"e05p0404","e":"e05","p":"p04","t":"Does Carlos know you’re coming?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0405","e":"e05","p":"p04","t":"No, he likes to be surprised. Now come, Gabrielle, come. Family should always hug, regardless of how they feel about each other.","s":"Mom Solis"},{"i":"e05p0501","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Wow, she’s a beauty, 30-footer?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0502","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"32.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0503","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Sweet, I sail. I’ve got a Flying Scot.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0504","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Well, we have several yachting enthusiasts here at Barcliff Academy. I’d be happy to introduce them to you.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0505","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"That sounds great.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0506","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Wonderful.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0507","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"If we decide to enroll your children.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0508","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"To be honest, Mr. and Mrs. Scavo, your children’s education background is a bit more common than we would prefer.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0509","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"But Mrs. Van de Kamp mentioned they were identical twins?","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0510","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Yes, Completely identical. You can’t tell them apart. They’re like bookends.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0511","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"We do strive for diversity here at Barcliff. Identical twins could make for an interesting addition.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0512","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"The boys are fascinating, they even have their own twin secret language, don’t they, Tom?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0513","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Yeah, it’s pretty scary.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0514","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Not really so much scary as highly developed.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0515","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Yeah, they bark and growl at each other.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0516","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Sorry, Tom, Mr. Lentz was trying to say something. Sorry, Go ahead, Mr. Lentz.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0517","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"I’d love to meet these twins of yours. I tell you what, I’m gonna put them on our “must-meet list”.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0518","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Terrific!","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0519","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Thank you so much. What is a “must-meet list”?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0520","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"We bring them in for observation.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0521","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Observation?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0522","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Mm, to see how they play with the other children, how they respond to authority, that sort of thing.","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0523","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"Great.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p0524","e":"e05","p":"p05","t":"That sounds wonderful.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0601","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Hey, kids ready?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0602","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Almost, thanks again for driving them to the bus.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0603","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Happy to do it, I miss them.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0604","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Did you hear there was a break-in at Mrs. Frome’s the other night?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0605","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Yeah, I heard they didn’t take anything.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0606","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Well, it doesn’t make it any less frightening. I mean, he could have been a sexual predator.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0607","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"And he ended up at Mrs. Frome’s? Boy, that would have been a lose-lose situation.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0608","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Rex, that’s not the point. The point is I don’t feel safe, and I was wondering if you could spend the night.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0609","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"You’re in the NRA, you own like four guns! If somebody broke in, I’d expect you to protect me.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0610","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Rex, the truth is, with the kids gone, I’ll be all by myself in this house for the first time in 17 years.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0611","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Honey, I know it’s hard to hear, but the marriage counseling might not work out. You need to get used to being alone.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0612","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"You’re right. That was hard to hear.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0613","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"What are you doing?","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0614","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"That is for the kids’ trip.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0615","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Oh, come on, I’m staying in a motel, I haven’t had a decent meal in weeks.","s":"Rex"},{"i":"e05p0616","e":"e05","p":"p06","t":"Honey, the marriage counseling might not work out. You need to get used to bad cooking.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p0701","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Hey, screwdriver girl. I just came by to tell you that I took your evidence into the lab for fingerprints.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0702","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Oh, really, that’s great.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0703","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"So I’ll call you if I hear something.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0704","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Okay. Whoops, sorry.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0705","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Actually, I’d like to call you anyway if that’s OK.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0706","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Oh, you seem like a really sweet guy in an interesting line of work, but I’m not really available.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0707","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Oh, you have a boyfriend?","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0708","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Yeah, sort of. It’s hard to explain, even to myself.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0709","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"10-4, I’m on my way, I gotta go, apparently there’s a hostage situation. So you’re really turning me down? Boy, my self-esteem can’t take this.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0710","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"I’m sorry.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0711","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"No, it’s just, now my ability to help those hostages has been compromised. Still don’t blame yourself for what might happen.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0712","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Blame myself?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0713","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Yeah, it’s just hard to rescue folks when you don’t feel good about yourself. Ah, they’ll probably all die anyway.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0714","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"OK, fine, I’ll go out with you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0715","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Great, I’ll call you.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0716","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Now that you’ve got your date, you can tell me what that really means, that 907A.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0717","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Someone’s TV was playing too loud.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0718","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"Well, thank god for The Thin Blue Line.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p0719","e":"e05","p":"p07","t":"I’ll call you.","s":"Thompson"},{"i":"e05p0801","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"I’ll be outside doing my yoga.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0802","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"Mom, I’ll be right back. Do you have to do that now? My mother’s here.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0803","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"Hey! I’m not gonna stop my life just because she decides to show up. Unannounced, I might add.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0804","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"She’s family, she doesn’t need an invitation.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0805","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"Whatever, it’s rude.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p0806","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"It’s really pretty, mama. You were always good with your hands.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0807","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"I assume you didn’t insist that I travel 2000 miles for small talk. So why am I here.","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0808","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"She is unhappy. I’ve given her everything she ever wanted, but it doesn’t seem to make a difference. I feel her drifting further and further away. And lately I’ve started thinking that maybe...","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0809","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"So you think she’s cheating on you?","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0810","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"I think so.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0811","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"We can talk about your problems, but I’m not gonna have any of that. Do you have any proof?","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0812","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"No, It's just a feeling.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0813","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"I had that feeling with your father and that whore waitress, and I was right. Always trust your feelings.","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0814","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"So what do I do?","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0815","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"You don’t do anything. I’ll take care of it.","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0816","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"Thank you, mom.","s":"Carlos"},{"i":"e05p0817","e":"e05","p":"p08","t":"I’m sorry I had to hit you, but we’re strong people, and we don’t cry about our problems. We find ways to fix them.","s":"Mama Solis"},{"i":"e05p0901","e":"e05","p":"p09","t":"While the residents of Wisteria Lane kept up their patrols in an effort to prevent future break-ins, Lynette hatched a plan to break her children into Barcliff Academy.","s":"Alice"},{"i":"e05p0902","e":"e05","p":"p09","t":"Boys, wake up. Come on, we’re gonna have some fun today... Come on.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0903","e":"e05","p":"p09","t":"I bet you can beat me. If I can still see your head, the pool’s not deep enough.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p0904","e":"e05","p":"p09","t":"Are your boys usually so docile?","s":"Headmaster"},{"i":"e05p0905","e":"e05","p":"p09","t":"They are always a little shy at first. Look at that concentration, Porter loves his puzzles.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1001","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"Mama, I’ll be right back, I’m going to the store.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1002","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"Gabrielle, I’m coming with you. I want to make some tamales for Carlos.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1003","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"No, no, Juanita, I’m not going to the supermarket. I’m going to the lingerie store.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1004","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"Good, I need some bras.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1005","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"I’m gonna be a while, I might get a facial.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1006","e":"e05","p":"p10","t":"I have a face.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1101","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"Hey, Mike.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1102","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"Hey, how’s it going?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1103","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"Good, I just came by to say hello. So you remember the cop from the neighborhood watch meeting? He agreed to run a fingerprint check on the screwdriver I found at Mrs. Frome’s house.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1104","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"He did? Nothing was taken.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1105","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"Still somebody broke in, it is a crime. So the weird thing is the cop asked me out, on a date, and I sort of said yes. I was just curious what you thought about that.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1106","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"You’re asking my permission to go out with him?","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1107","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"No, I just was wondering your opinion.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1108","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"I don’t really have one.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1109","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"OK, great, fine. Thank you.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1110","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"Susan, wait. I’m sorry, my life is just really complicated right now.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1111","e":"e05","p":"p11","t":"You don’t have to explain. It’s complicated, I get it.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1201","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"Paul? Oh, Zachary, sorry, the door was open and...","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1202","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"It’s OK, you can come in.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1203","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"Is your father here? We’re scheduled to do a patrol today.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1204","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"He had to go out of town, again.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1205","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"Oh, well, I guess I can do it by myself. Wow, this place is just immaculate.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1206","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"My mom liked things clean.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1207","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"Zach, she would be very proud of you. What happened to your varnish?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1208","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"That’s where my mother died. I messed up the floor trying to get out the blood. I’ll let my dad know that you stopped by.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1209","e":"e05","p":"p12","t":"OK. Zach, do you have plans for dinner?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1301","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"So you shop a lot, huh?","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1302","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Yeah, so?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1303","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Most women that shop a lot, it’s because they don’t have anything better to do.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1304","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"What’s your point?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1305","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Well, if you had children...","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1306","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Here we go.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1307","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"I’m just saying that children give your life a purpose, you get so busy taking care of them that you don’t have any time to wonder if you’re happy.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1308","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"You know, Juanita, this is so like you, I invited you to a nice shopping trip and you found ways to upset me.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1309","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Oh, you didn’t invite me, I invited myself. You keep looking at your watch, is there someplace you have to be?","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1310","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"No, And for the record, I’m not one of those women who have a hole in their heart that can only be filled by a baby. I like my life a lot, it’s very fulfilling.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1311","e":"e05","p":"p13","t":"Excuse my daughter-in-law, she’s very fulfilled.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1401","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"So he just blew you off?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1402","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"I told him another man asked me out, It was a perfect opportunity for Mike to be jealous, and nothing.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1403","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"Did you bat your eyes?You know, It doesn’t work if you don’t bat your eyes.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1404","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"Honey, I batted everything that wasn’t nailed down, I’m telling you, nothing.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1405","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"Thanks.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1406","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"So what’s going on there?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1407","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"Gophers. Listen, I’m sorry about Mike, I know how much you like him.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1408","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"No, maybe it’s my fault, maybe I just imagined an entire relationship with this man that didn’t exist.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1409","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"There has been flirting, I have seen it.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1410","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"And the flirting made me think that he was kind, trustworthy, honest and hygienic.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1411","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"That’s how it is with me. A guy just smiles at me three times and I’m picking out wedding china. I’m a mess.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1412","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"But to be fair, that’s part of your charm.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1413","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"That’s what happened with Carl, I only dated him for a couple of months, I filled in the blanks, I married him, it was a disaster.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1414","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"You think Mike is a Carl in disguise?","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1415","e":"e05","p":"p14","t":"I don’t know. What does that mean anyway? “My life is complicated.”","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1501","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"If I wanted to sit around and wait for nothing, I could do it on the can. You’re late, what’s with the face?","s":"Noah"},{"i":"e05p1502","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"I screwed up, I broke into the Frome’s house and almost got caught.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1503","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"What’s ‘almost’?","s":"Noah"},{"i":"e05p1504","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"I accidentally left something behind with my prints on it.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1505","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"Did you ever hear of gloves?","s":"Noah"},{"i":"e05p1506","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"It’s the suburbs. I didn’t think it would matter. Anyway, the police are running a check and I’m in the system. I gotta pull up stakes before they come looking for me.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1507","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"That’s a sweet sound, laughter like that, huh? Pisses me off. If and when your cover is blown, you disappear. Until then, you keep fixing the neighbors’ pipes.","s":"Noah"},{"i":"e05p1508","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"The more time I spend in this town, the more I think we’re making a mistake. These are nice people.","s":"Mike"},{"i":"e05p1509","e":"e05","p":"p15","t":"My money says one of them isn’t. No more screw-ups.","s":"Noah"},{"i":"e05p1601","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"I’m getting something to drink, do you want something?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1602","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Don’t be mad.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1603","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"I waited at that motel for three hours for you. I had to use a month’s worth of lunch money to pay for that room.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1604","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"It’s not my fault. Juanita hasn’t let me out of her sight since she got here.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1605","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Really? Well, I don’t see her now.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1606","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"She is watching her Mexican soap opera, the rebel’s virgin daughter is about to be seduced by the escaped desperado.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1607","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"So until she puts out, Juanita won’t even know that I’m gone. Come on, I said I was sorry.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1608","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Just so you know, I’ve turned down half the pep squad for you.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1609","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"You can’t be serious.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1610","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"You know I’m starting to think that maybe I should be with someone my own age.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1611","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"I thought teenage girls bored you, John. I thought what we had was beyond that.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1612","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"So did I.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1613","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":" So then why do you want to go back to something you don’t want?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1614","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"I don’t know.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1615","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Maybe you’re tired of me.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1616","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"No, I want to be with you.","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1617","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Then why are we arguing?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1618","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Gabrielle.","s":"Juanita"},{"i":"e05p1619","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Damn it. The virgin gave it up already?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1620","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"I want you so bad. When can I see you again?","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1621","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Tomorrow, meet me at the front entrance of the mall after school.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1622","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"What about your mother-in-law?","s":"John"},{"i":"e05p1623","e":"e05","p":"p16","t":"Don’t worry, I’ll think of something.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1701","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"A donation? Now Barcliff wants a donation?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1702","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"Apparently we’re in competition with one other family. A generous donation will ensure our kids beat them out.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1703","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"How generous?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1704","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"15 thousand.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1705","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"We don’t have that.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1706","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"That’s what I told them.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1707","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"So what do we do? Public school is out unless we move to a new district.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1708","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"We’re not moving.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1709","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"Maybe it’s time that we looked into homeschooling.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1710","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"I know you did not just say that.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1711","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"Honey, it’s got its advantages. Kids homeschooled do better in their later years.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1712","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"They won’t make it to their later years if I have to spend all day with them.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1713","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"Honey, sometimes you’ve just got to make the sacrifice. It’s probably the best thing for the kids.","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1714","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"Why don’t I just put them back in me and cook them until they’re civilized.","s":"Lynette"},{"i":"e05p1715","e":"e05","p":"p17","t":"You’d be cool with that?","s":"Tom"},{"i":"e05p1801","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I’ve never had plum pudding before.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1802","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I’m serving it this year for Christmas. I like to try out new recipes before the actual holiday. That way, if the cookbook has got it wrong, I can fix it.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1803","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"You must really like Christmas. You and Mr. Van de Camp always have the best decorations on your lawn.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1804","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I adore the holidays. I never get depressed if there’s a beautifully decorated tree to look out at.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1805","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"My mom and I would always decorate our tree together. This Christmas is gonna be weird.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1806","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Oh, Zach. You know, my mother died when I was young, she was hit by a car. It was right before Christmas, as a matter of fact.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1807","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"We were all singing carols and the dog was howling, because everybody in my family sings off-key except for me.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1808","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Anyway, it was just a terrible ruckus. So no one noticed when my mother went across the street to give the neighbors a gift.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1809","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"And the next thing we heard was brakes screeching. Most of my family went to the hospital, but I stayed home because I was so young.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1810","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"When I looked out of the window, I saw all of my mother’s blood on the street.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1811","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Nobody was doing anything about it, so I got a hose and I washed it off. And once it was clean, I felt so much better.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1812","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I’ve never told anyone that story before.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1813","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Those are the most interesting ones, the stories that we never tell anyone.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1814","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Yeah, you’re probably right.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1815","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I have one. It’s more of a secret really. I know why my mom killed herself.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1816","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"You do?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1817","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"It was something I did, something bad.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1818","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"What did you do, Zach? Sweetheart.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1819","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"No, I’d better not. I shouldn’t have said anything. I shouldn’t have done this. If my dad found out ...","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1820","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Zach, calm down. I won’t tell your father.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1821","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"I can’t get you involved.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1822","e":"e05","p":"p18","t":"Zachary, it’s all right.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1901","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"I can’t believe Zach said that, what else did he tell you?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1902","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"That was it. Just that Mary Alice killed herself because of something he had done.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1903","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"You couldn’t get any more out of him?","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1904","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Oh, I tried, but he was so nervous. He actually started shaking, then he just left.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1905","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"OK, this is getting really weird. I think we should go to the police.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1906","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"And tell them what? We don’t even have the note anymore, we gave it to Paul.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1907","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Then you’re gonna have to get Zach to tell you something, so we have more to go on.","s":"Susan"},{"i":"e05p1908","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Girls, you don’t understand, this poor kid is scared out of his mind.","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1909","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Oh, for god’s sake, Bree, you’re a woman. Manipulate him. That’s what we do.","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1910","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"But how?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1911","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"I don’t know, how do you usually manipulate Rex?","s":"Gabrielle"},{"i":"e05p1912","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Hello, Zachary. Are you free for dinner tonight?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1913","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Sure.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1914","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Oh, good, because last night you put me in such a holiday mood, so I’m gonna make roast turkey and candy yams and eggnog. Have you ever had real old-fashioned eggnog?","s":"Bree"},{"i":"e05p1915","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"I don’t think so.","s":"Zach"},{"i":"e05p1916","e":"e05","p":"p19","t":"Oh, you are gonna love it. It has quite a kick.","s":"Bree"}];
